dev","id":72257341,"login":"muhammadafzal-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjU3MzQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadafzal-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadafzal-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadafzal-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadafzal-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadafzal-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadafzal-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/muhammadafzal-dev/micro-frontend-admin-portal/commits/8e3587dbaad970cdd9a751d70a3caa93a6076349/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T08:12:13Z","email":"afzalj166@gmail.com","name":"muhammadafzal-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T08:12:13Z","email":"afzalj166@gmail.com","name":"muhammadafzal-dev"},"message":"feat: multi-tenant admin portal micro-frontend (Next.js Multi-Zones)\n\nFour independently deployable Next.js apps composed on one domain via\npath-based routing (shell rewrites), plus three shared workspace packages.\n\n- shell: host, owns / and rewrites /auth /dashboard /settings to zones\n- auth: mock login/logout, HMAC-signed HttpOnly session cookie\n- dashboard: user-specific stats, projects, analytics\n- settings: account, profile, security\n- @portal/types, @portal/config, @portal/ui shared packages\n- yarn workspaces + Turborepo, TypeScript strict, Vercel-ready, no backend\n\nVerified: builds (4/4), typecheck (7/7), login/logout, per-user data\nisolation, protected-route redirects, tampered-cookie rejection.","tree":{"sha":"3c655f7fedc35aac39fc830ab103f1cac59c96fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/muhammadafzal-dev/micro-frontend-admin-portal/git/trees/3c655f7fedc35aac39fc830ab103f1cac59c96fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/muhammadafzal-dev/micro-frontend-admin-portal/git/commits/8e3587d