://api.github.com/users/plazasgiovanny/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plazasgiovanny","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plazasgiovanny/home-microfrontend/commits/0a068c0511037b6abaa2a578b8197efb9df370f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:59:59Z","email":"plazasgiovanny@gmail.com","name":"giovanny"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:59:59Z","email":"plazasgiovanny@gmail.com","name":"giovanny"},"message":"Migrar Home al mismo patron Flux que Rendimientos (gobernanza compartida)\n\nDecision de gobernanza tecnica (lectura U4 5.1): aunque Home y\nRendimientos son repos/equipos independientes, ambos gestionan su\nestado con el mismo patron (Action -> Dispatcher -> DataManager ->\nService -> Store -> useSyncExternalStore), cada uno con su propio\ndispatcher/store (sin compartir instancia entre bundles). El service de\nHome simula latencia en vez de llamar a un backend inexistente. Ademas,\nUI rediseñada inspirada en la home real de Mercado Pago (franja de\nsaludo, tarjeta superpuesta, accesos rapidos, actividad reciente) sobre\nla marca ya definida en U2. 6 tests nuevos en verde.","tree":{"sha":"3a62e2c0cb2918e15759c847d393df2a7124f253","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plazasgiovanny/home-microfrontend/git/trees/3a62e2c0cb2918e15759c847d393df2a7124f253"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plazasgiovanny/home-microfrontend/git/commits/0a068c0511037b6abaa2a578b8197efb9df370f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41165304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plazasgiovanny/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plazasgiovanny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plazasgiovanny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plazasgiovanny/gists{/gist_id}","gr