://api.github.com/users/plazasgiovanny/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plazasgiovanny","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plazasgiovanny/shell-orchestrator/commits/229a119482a162444daeff9d2c3f032f52cf4400/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T10:00:13Z","email":"plazasgiovanny@gmail.com","name":"giovanny"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T10:00:13Z","email":"plazasgiovanny@gmail.com","name":"giovanny"},"message":"Endurecer el shell: observabilidad, contrato y responsividad movil\n\n- Logging estructurado por request y por fragmento (metodo, ruta,\n  status, duracion, dominio) -- responde a la lectura U4 5.3\n  (identificar que microfrontend genero un error, medir tiempos de\n  carga por dominio).\n- GET /health (paridad con los MFE servers) y manejador 404 propio en\n  vez del default de Express.\n- fetchFragment valida la forma del FragmentResponse antes de usarlo --\n  un MFE con JSON malformado degrada a fallback igual que un timeout.\n- Se retira cors() del shell: nunca se consume via fetch() cross-origin\n  (sirve navegacion top-level), el CORS real ya vive en los MFE\n  servers.\n- Responsividad: app a pantalla completa en moviles reales/emulados\n  (sin margenes ni tarjeta encogida), tarjeta con sombra centrada solo\n  en desktop (@media min-width:481px).","tree":{"sha":"5c5ff6f5ace1790f9c04ef1995f37039d62c0e11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plazasgiovanny/shell-orchestrator/git/trees/5c5ff6f5ace1790f9c04ef1995f37039d62c0e11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plazasgiovanny/shell-orchestrator/git/commits/229a119482a162444daeff9d2c3f032f52cf4400","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41165304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plazasgiovanny/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaza