vpakspace@users.noreply.github.com","name":"vpakspace"},"message":"ДЗ «Жизненный цикл ПО»: Scrum/Kanban доски в Kaiten\n\nПространство «Команда разработки»: доски Backlog, Sprint, Kanban.\nКолонка «Готово для тестирования» добавлена после «В работе».\nЗадачи Frontend/Backend с подзадачами, комментариями и трудозатратами\nпроведены до колонки «Готово». README + 8 скриншотов.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qo3jsstpjNsbRw5Y1TaAqu","tree":{"sha":"82fa49f76da4b003ac630b6fefbe736392422e46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vpakspace/kaiten-hw/git/trees/82fa49f76da4b003ac630b6fefbe736392422e46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vpakspace/kaiten-hw/git/commits/ce49b33d7de60a3863e80d15e0cae205761bd767","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130538162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpakspace/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpakspace/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpakspace/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpakspace/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vpakspace","id":130538162,"login":"vpakspace","node_id":"U_kgDOB8fasg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpakspace/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpakspace/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpakspace/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpakspace/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpakspace/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpakspace","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vpakspace/kaiten-hw/commit/ce49b33d7de60a3863e80d15e0cae205761bd767","node_id":"C_kwDOT7IirNoAKGNlNDliMzNkN2RlNjBh