ane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/clevergy/commits/6314401d0da1f4794701676a7ff747758d550da6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:40:58Z","email":"kinlane@gmail.com","name":"Kin Lane"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:40:58Z","email":"kinlane@gmail.com","name":"Kin Lane"},"message":"Record who wrote each artifact in this repository\n\nprovenance.yml lists every artifact in this repo and what is known about its\nauthorship: generated or derived by API Evangelist, searched or harvested from the\nprovider, or unknown.\n\n`unknown` means we have no record — NOT that the provider did not write it. It is\nrecorded rather than guessed, because a guess at a silent file is what produced\nevery provenance defect this catalog has had to correct.\n\nA manifest describes an artifact without modifying it, which is the only honest\nway to record provenance for a document the provider wrote — and the only possible\nway for a JSON collection an importer validates, or for openapi/_original/, which\nhas to stay byte-identical to what was fetched.\n\nGenerated by all/0-working/build-provenance-manifest.py. Drift between this file\nand the directory it describes is checked by check-provenance-manifest.py.","tree":{"sha":"33f702f8a66a745ea2653c510263d96d9929e88f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/clevergy/git/trees/33f702f8a66a745ea2653c510263d96d9929e88f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/clevergy/git/commits/6314401d0da1f4794701676a7ff747758d550da6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/events{/privacy}","followers_