count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T23:08:47Z","email":"kinlane@gmail.com","name":"Kin Lane"},"message":"Publish the delivery model — what was measured, not a new score (roadmap#41)\n\nA composite is presented as one comparable number across every provider and it is\nnot: a self-hosted 51.7 and a SaaS 51.7 were produced by asking the same\nquestions of two products where several questions only make sense for one.\n\nModelling on roadmap#39 showed the fix is NOT to adjust the scores — exempting\nthe commercial checks moved the open-source cohort mean 41.9 -> 42.0 and cost\nseveral providers a band. The number is close to right. What was missing is the\nlabel saying what was measured.\n\n  saas         15,295   unknown      11,061\n  open-core       447   library         428   self-hosted     368\n\nThe 40% unknown is honest rather than guessed: a product licence is on record for\n1,191 providers, and only 914 carry an SPDX name the classifier can read.","tree":{"sha":"b4860d3827aec5ec67f09b7ec354982a52485126","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/clevergy/git/trees/b4860d3827aec5ec67f09b7ec354982a52485126"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/clevergy/git/commits/679d3e21dfbc29044f292c6887ef918e403f5071","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kinlane","id":56100,"login":"kinlane","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.