s://github.com/hyperFagianni","id":286469233,"login":"hyperFagianni","node_id":"U_kgDOERMscQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commit/4df949ac6f006bd1d871467f1445aec9949cba6f","node_id":"C_kwDOT7NnAdoAKDRkZjk0OWFjNmYwMDZiZDFkODcxNDY3ZjE0NDVhZWM5OTQ5Y2JhNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commit/f536a107e05a9656d670a9ac8f55c12f89c61922","sha":"f536a107e05a9656d670a9ac8f55c12f89c61922","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/f536a107e05a9656d670a9ac8f55c12f89c61922"}],"sha":"4df949ac6f006bd1d871467f1445aec9949cba6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/4df949ac6f006bd1d871467f1445aec9949cba6f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286469233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni","id":286469233,"login":"hyperFagianni","node_id":"U_kgDOERMscQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/f536a107e05a9656d670a9ac8f55c12f89c61922/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:31:10Z","email":"laciufola@gmail.com","name":"hyperFagianni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:31:10Z","email":"laciufola@gmail.com","name":"hyperFagianni"},"message":"Harden Metro config for concurrent native builds, update Play Store checklist\n\nmetro.config.js: exclude native build intermediates (CMake .cxx dirs,\nGradle build/ output) from the file watcher. Running `expo start` and\na local `gradlew` build against the same node_modules crashed the dev\nserver — CMake creates and deletes compiler-capability-test\ndirectories fast enough that Metro''s watcher hit an ENOENT trying to\nwatch one that was already gone.\n\nstore/CHECKLIST.md: recorded that the first production AAB was built\nand signed locally (JDK 17 + Android SDK now configured on this\nmachine) with a dedicated release keystore, since this month''s free\nEAS build quota was already exhausted. Keystore lives outside the repo\nwith credentials backed up separately — see the checklist for the\n\"back this up now\" details.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30a8edfb3d0716e319837e59b69cc29cbdaf99f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/git/trees/30a8edfb3d0716e319837e59b69cc29cbdaf99f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/git/commits/f536a107e05a9656d670a9ac8f55c12f89c61922","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286469233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni","id":286469233,"login":"hyperFagianni","node_id":"U_kgDOERMscQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commit/f536a107e05a9656d670a9ac8f55c12f89c61922","node_id":"C_kwDOT7NnAdoAKGY1MzZhMTA3ZTA1YTk2NTZkNjcwYTlhYzhmNTVjMTJmODljNjE5MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commit/740a09eb68d671ec5b97600cde63e54860033e59","sha":"740a09eb68d671ec5b97600cde63e54860033e59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/740a09eb68d671ec5b97600cde63e54860033e59"}],"sha":"f536a107e05a9656d670a9ac8f55c12f89c61922","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/f536a107e05a9656d670a9ac8f55c12f89c61922"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286469233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni","id":286469233,"login":"hyperFagianni","node_id":"U_kgDOERMscQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/740a09eb68d671ec5b97600cde63e54860033e59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:53:03Z","email":"laciufola@gmail.com","name":"hyperFagianni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:53:03Z","email":"laciufola@gmail.com","name":"hyperFagianni"},"message":"Add web platform support (Vercel-ready), same codebase\n\nSame source serves Android/iOS/web via Expo Router + react-native-web\n— no duplicated project. Verified with a real build + browser smoke\ntest (Playwright): SQLite works via expo-sqlite''s WASM build, gesture\nhandling, glassmorphism UI and the carrier picker all render/behave\ncorrectly on web with no code changes beyond:\n\n- metro.config.js: teach Metro to treat .wasm as an asset, and set the\n  COOP/COEP headers expo-sqlite''s WASM SQLite needs for OPFS\n  persistence (dev server only)\n- vercel.json: build command, output dir, and the same COOP/COEP\n  headers for the deployed static export\n- backgroundTask.ts: skip registration on web (Platform.OS check) —\n  there''s no background-execution equivalent for a web page, so the\n  warning it threw is now just a silent, expected no-op\n\nBackground sync/notifications intentionally have no web equivalent —\ndoing so would need a push-notification server, which conflicts with\nthe zero-server-cost approach used everywhere else in this project.\nThe web build relies on manual pull-to-refresh instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sh