{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286469233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni","id":286469233,"login":"hyperFagianni","node_id":"U_kgDOERMscQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/27e46dc65f449738c063c33f1bc6fd36ffd50be6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T15:24:27Z","email":"laciufola@gmail.com","name":"hyperFagianni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T15:24:27Z","email":"laciufola@gmail.com","name":"hyperFagianni"},"message":"Prepare Google Play submission materials\n\n- Link project to EAS (eas init), production build profile ready\n- Store listing copy, Data Safety form answers, feature graphic,\n  content-rating guidance (store/)\n- Privacy policy + minimal landing page for GitHub Pages (docs/)\n- Checklist of remaining manual steps (Play Console account, hosting\n  the privacy page, uploading the AAB to internal/closed testing)\n\nNote: the account''s free EAS Android build quota for this month is\nalready exhausted (resets 2026-09-01) — see store/CHECKLIST.md for\nthe options (wait, upgrade plan, or a local Gradle build).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6418aa2c4acc2c4ed689e073b4eb19cc3059df9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/git/trees/e6418aa2c4acc2c4ed689e073b4eb19cc3059df9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/git/commits/27e46dc65f449738c063c33f1bc6fd36ffd50be6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286469233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni","id":286469233,"login":"hyperFagianni","node_id":"U_kgDOERMscQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commit/27e46dc65f449738c063c33f1bc6fd36ffd50be6","node_id":"C_kwDOT7NnAdoAKDI3ZTQ2ZGM2NWY0NDk3MzhjMDYzYzMzZjFiYzZmZDM2ZmZkNTBiZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commit/0e3e18971defb276a9672f31c94cf9a27eb3f85e","sha":"0e3e18971defb276a9672f31c94cf9a27eb3f85e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/0e3e18971defb276a9672f31c94cf9a27eb3f85e"}],"sha":"27e46dc65f449738c063c33f1bc6fd36ffd50be6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/27e46dc65f449738c063c33f1bc6fd36ffd50be6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286469233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni","id":286469233,"login":"hyperFagianni","node_id":"U_kgDOERMscQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/0e3e18971defb276a9672f31c94cf9a27eb3f85e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:56:53Z","email":"laciufola@gmail.com","name":"hyperFagianni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:56:53Z","email":"laciufola@gmail.com","name":"hyperFagianni"},"message":"Deep-link external carrier tracking pages, add real app icon, silence expected LogBox warning\n\n- carriers.ts: externalTrackingUrl -> buildTrackingUrl(trackingNumber),\n  deep-linking straight to the shipment result wherever the carrier''s\n  site supports it via URL (confirmed per-carrier by hand or by\n  inspecting each site''s search form/routing): Poste Italiane and SDA\n  (SDA''s tracking now runs through Poste''s own system), BRT, TNT (via\n  FedEx''s site), InPost, Vinted Go. GLS and Amazon Logistics don''t\n  support this (GLS''s form only POSTs, Amazon has no public per-code\n  page) — flagged via deepLinkSupported and still copy-to-clipboard.\n- New app icon/adaptive icon/favicon generated from the user-provided\n  logo, with the corners outside the rounded-square artwork made\n  transparent (flood-fill) instead of solid white. Dropped the\n  monochrome Android icon variant — deriving one from a flattened\n  image with no internal transparency only produced a solid blob,\n  worse than not having one.\n- Silenced expo-notifications'' \"remote push removed from Expo Go\"\n  console.error via LogBox.ignoreLogs: expected/harmless (Trackly only\n  ever uses local notifications) but was surfacing as a full-screen\n  error during testing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97b7247bda472dd54665b74916fb795fbd16b32b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/git/trees/97b7247bda472dd54665b74916fb795fbd16b32b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/git/commits/0e3e18971defb276a9672f31c94cf9a27eb3f85e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286469233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni","id":286469233,"login":"hyperFagianni","node_id":"U_kgDOERMscQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commit/0e3e18971defb276a9672f31c94cf9a27eb3f85e","node_id":"C_kwDOT7NnAdoAKDBlM2UxODk3MWRlZmIyNzZhOTY3MmYzMWM5NGNmOWEyN2ViM2Y4NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commit/e3ca76d5ea451da2f81e76cd78a1b36479758d0f","sha":"e3ca76d5ea451da2f81e76cd78a1b36479758d0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/e3ca76d5ea451da2f81e76cd78a1b36479758d0f"}],"sha":"0e3e18971defb276a9672f31c94cf9a27eb3f85e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/0e3e18971defb276a9672f31c94cf9a27eb3f85e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286469233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni","id":286469233,"login":"hyperFagianni","node_id":"U_kgDOERMscQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/e3ca76d5ea451da2f81e76cd78a1b36479758d0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:25:53Z","email":"laciufola@gmail.com","name":"hyperFagianni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:25:53Z","email":"laciufola@gmail.com","name":"hyperFagianni"},"message":"Replace 17TRACK aggregator with direct carrier APIs + info screen\n\n17TRACK (and every multi-carrier aggregator) caps its free tier sooner\nor later, which conflicts with \"free forever\". Only UPS, FedEx and DHL\npublish a genuinely free self-serve tracking API (no business contract\nrequired) — verified against their developer portals. Those three now\nget live status + automatic notifications via direct API integrations\n(src/api/providers/). Every other common Italian carrier (Poste\nItaliane, BRT, GLS, SDA, TNT, Amazon Logistics) plus InPost and Vinted\nGo stay in the app as organized entries, but open the carrier''s own\nofficial tracking page (copy-to-clipboard + browser) instead of a live\nstatus, since no free API exists for them.\n\nAlso adds an in-app \"i\" info screen explaining how Trackly works,\nthe live-vs-link-out distinction, gestures, and notification limits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"04a71a430d11edc4b182375109259c84223fc017","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/git/trees/04a71a430d11edc4b182375109259c84223fc017"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/git/commits/e3ca76d5ea451da2f81e76cd78a1b36479758d0f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286469233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni","id":286469233,"login":"hyperFagianni","node_id":"U_kgDOERMscQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commit/e3ca76d5ea451da2f81e76cd78a1b36479758d0f","node_id":"C_kwDOT7NnAdoAKGUzY2E3NmQ1ZWE0NTFkYTJmODFlNzZjZDc4YTFiMzY0Nzk3NThkMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commit/a4c44f42cd296b708321baa48a5c6e2c1ee29cb1","sha":"a4c44f42cd296b708321baa48a5c6e2c1ee29cb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/a4c44f42cd296b708321baa48a5c6e2c1ee29cb1"}],"sha":"e3ca76d5ea451da2f81e76cd78a1b36479758d0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/e3ca76d5ea451da2f81e76cd78a1b36479758d0f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286469233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni","id":286469233,"login":"hyperFagianni","node_id":"U_kgDOERMscQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/commits/a4c44f42cd296b708321baa48a5c6e2c1ee29cb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:19:29Z","email":"laciufola@gmail.com","name":"hyperFagianni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:19:29Z","email":"laciufola@gmail.com","name":"hyperFagianni"},"message":"Build Trackly: multi-carrier shipment tracker (Expo SDK 54)\n\nFull app scaffold: SQLite-backed shipment list with swipeable cards\n(delete/notifications toggle), add-shipment flow with a curated carrier\npicker (Poste Italiane, BRT, GLS, SDA, DHL, UPS, FedEx, TNT, Amazon\nLogistics), shipment detail with event timeline, glassmorphism UI\n(expo-blur + reanimated), local notifications with a shared status-diff\nengine driving both pull-to-refresh and expo-background-task, a hidden\nad slot behind a config flag, and an optional Cloudflare Worker proxy\nso the 17TRACK API key never ships in the app bundle.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a200649a72479e8867aa2d41ed5190f4fccf728","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/git/trees/5a200649a72479e8867aa2d41ed5190f4fccf728"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperFagianni/Trackly/git/commits/a4c44f42cd296b708321baa48a5c6e2c1ee29cb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286469233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperFagianni","id":286469233,"login":"hyperFagianni","node_id":"U_kgDOERMscQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyperFagianni/orgs","rec