e":"2026-08-17T22:12:37Z","email":"stefan.steg@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Stegmueller"},"message":"Genericize the project and document forking for another club\n\nClub identity (federation, club number, name) now comes entirely from repo\nvariables/env, with generic placeholder defaults (\"Musterverein\") instead\nof TC Rot 1971 hardcoded in source. The GitHub Actions workflow reads these\nfrom repo Variables instead of hardcoding them, and mock fixtures use a\nplaceholder club name. README rewritten to be club-agnostic throughout, plus\na new \"Forking this for another club\" section with concrete setup steps.\n\nTC-Rot-1971/nuliga-mfe itself keeps working unchanged via repo variables\nset to match (BAD / 33232 / TC Rot 1971).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b693551dfb4607f967419ee5724248de52ff31f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TC-Rot-1971/nuliga-mfe/git/trees/b693551dfb4607f967419ee5724248de52ff31f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TC-Rot-1971/nuliga-mfe/git/commits/fb526038471440702d9575a68d1e459830ac02c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8692592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sstegmueller/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sstegmueller/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sstegmueller/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sstegmueller/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sstegmueller","id":8692592,"login":"sstegmueller","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTI1OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sstegmueller/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sstegmueller/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sstegmueller/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sstegmueller/starred{/owner}{/r