s/ardour100/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ardour100","id":77058791,"login":"ardour100","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDU4Nzkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ardour100/AWS-solution-architect-associate/commits/10ed8695780b45aee95afce73d3479058b12fba6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:46:23Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:46:23Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"message":"Add question CRUD and exam flow APIs\n\n- Question management (admin-only, requireAdmin): create, list, get,\n  update, soft delete. Update appends an immutable version (same\n  group_id, version + 1, is_latest flipped off first to satisfy the\n  partial unique index inside the transaction)\n- Schema: questions.is_deleted (soft delete keeps exam history\n  referentially intact); exams.user_id now nullable for anonymous exams\n- Exam flow (open, optional auth): start exam with N random latest\n  questions (default 10, clamped to pool size), save answers per record,\n  strict exact-match grading on submit with answer-key reveal\n- authenticateOptional: attaches user only when a valid token is present;\n  provided-but-invalid tokens still get a 401\n- Pre-submit responses never expose is_correct; uuid path-param guards\n  turn PG 22P02 comparison errors into clean 404s\n\nVerified with 38 end-to-end checks covering CRUD, versioning, soft\ndelete, grading semantics, leaks, and auth boundaries.\n\nCo-Aut