s/ardour100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ardour100/AWS-solution-architect-associate/commits/cb0673061897943066e8133426e96a7eec6f56b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:02:04Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:02:04Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"message":"Add JWT auth: register, login, and role middleware\n\n- POST /api/auth/register: zod-validated email/password, bcryptjs\n  hashing, 409 on duplicate email, returns token + user\n- POST /api/auth/login: credential check with generic 401 on failure\n- JWT payload carries userId + role (JWT_SECRET / JWT_EXPIRES_IN env)\n- authenticateToken: Bearer parsing, 401 on missing/invalid/expired,\n  mounts req.user; requireAdmin: 403 for non-admins\n- Modular layout: auth/schemas, token, errors, service, controller,\n  middleware, router; JSON error handler at app level\n- GET /api/auth/me demonstrates authenticated-route wiring\n\nVerified with 18 end-to-end checks (register/login paths, 400/401/403/\n409 semantics, token expiry, role promotion) and a container rebuild.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ecb0a53d538300c2c14a2e2b6a336a214c68c51c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ardour100/AWS-solution-architect-associate/git/trees/ecb0a53d538300c2c14a2e2b6a336a214c68c51c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ardour100/AWS-solution-architect-associate/git/commits/cb0673061897943066e8133426e96a7eec6f56b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77058791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardo