rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/5f198fb254fc1e8e5476a39583a8a361d8b301cf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/78aee2eedb5116dcd639001410d2578769571014/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:16:44Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:16:44Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"chore(backend): guard against EVIDENCE_STORE=memory in deploy\n\nserverless-dotenv-plugin/useDotenv inject backend/.env into deployed\nfunctions, so the LOCAL EVIDENCE_STORE=memory default would silently reach\nproduction (in-memory store: PDFs lost on cold start, download 404).\nNew script backend/scripts/guard-no-memory-store.mjs runs as the predeploy\nlifecycle hook of ''pnpm -C backend run deploy'' and FAILS the deploy with a\nclear message when EVIDENCE_STORE=memory is present in backend/.env OR the\nshell environment (also runnable standalone with an env-file arg).\nProven: memory file -> exit 1; shell-env memory via predeploy -> exit 1\n(ELIFECYCLE, sls never runs); clean -> exit 0.","tree":{"sha":"4e52e628a2cd37d413f4af81a4372fe20e2d6faf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/4e52e628a2cd37d413f4af81a4372fe20e2d6faf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/78aee2eedb5116dcd639001410d2578769571014","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/78aee2eedb5116dcd639001410d2578769571014","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDc4YWVlMmVlZGI1MTE2ZGNkNjM5MDAxNDEwZDI1Nzg3Njk1NzEwMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/ddbb07a30d3c53656a5987246d69c6e309b91a85","sha":"ddbb07a30d3c53656a5987246d69c6e309b91a85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/ddbb07a30d3c53656a5987246d69c6e309b91a85"}],"sha":"78aee2eedb5116dcd639001410d2578769571014","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/78aee2eedb5116dcd639001410d2578769571014"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/ddbb07a30d3c53656a5987246d69c6e309b91a85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:15:16Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:15:16Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"chore(root): poll dynamodb readiness in demo:setup\n\nReplaces the blind sleep 3 with a real readiness poll\n(backend/scripts/wait-for-dynamodb.mjs, wired as db:wait): ListTables\nagainst DYNAMODB_LOCAL every 500ms up to 30s, exit 0 on first answer,\nexit 1 with a clear message on timeout. docker compose up -d returns\nbefore the Java container opens :8000, so db:create-table chained\nimmediately was flaky cold-start. Proven: db:down -> demo:setup ->\n''DynamoDB ready (attempt 3)'' -> table created -> 4 seeded, exit 0; dead\nendpoint -> clear failure after 30s, exit 1.","tree":{"sha":"7473dfe49185178de5a066ba9bca5b81ab00329c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/7473dfe49185178de5a066ba9bca5b81ab00329c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/ddbb07a30d3c53656a5987246d69c6e309b91a85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/ddbb07a30d3c53656a5987246d69c6e309b91a85","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGRkYmIwN2EzMGQzYzUzNjU2YTU5ODcyNDZkNjljNmUzMDliOTFhODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/b51c35a847dcb078411f26b68a9dff8053bde8fb","sha":"b51c35a847dcb078411f26b68a9dff8053bde8fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/b51c35a847dcb078411f26b68a9dff8053bde8fb"}],"sha":"ddbb07a30d3c53656a5987246d69c6e309b91a85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/ddbb07a30d3c53656a5987246d69c6e309b91a85"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/b51c35a847dcb078411f26b68a9dff8053bde8fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:13:53Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:13:53Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"fix(host): origin-guard console navigation + actionable error\n\nA stale backend/.env (created before this PR) has no APPROVER_BASE_URL, so\nTokenIssuer defaults to the backend origin and the mailed link would\nhard-navigate the console to http://localhost:4000 — a dead page with no\nUI feedback. DemoPage now validates the mailed link''s origin against\nwindow.location.origin before navigating (new pure helper isSameOrigin in\napi/mail.js): on mismatch it shows ''Set APPROVER_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000\nin backend/.env and restart the backend'' and does NOT navigate. RTL tests:\nmismatch path (no navigation + error), happy path (navigates), helper unit\ntests.","tree":{"sha":"8b0fc33660c7a6d497af0af32ce596995bcd4542","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/8b0fc33660c7a6d497af0af32ce596995bcd4542"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/b51c35a847dcb078411f26b68a9dff8053bde8fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/b51c35a847dcb078411f26b68a9dff8053bde8fb","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGI1MWMzNWE4NDdkY2IwNzg0MTFmMjZiNjhhOWRmZjgwNTNiZGU4ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/256da4bf560e0bfc3d70e284f60cb9a5d3375ca6","sha":"256da4bf560e0bfc3d70e284f60cb9a5d3375ca6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/256da4bf560e0bfc3d70e284f60cb9a5d3375ca6"}],"sha":"b51c35a847dcb078411f26b68a9dff8053bde8fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/b51c35a847dcb078411f26b68a9dff8053bde8fb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/256da4bf560e0bfc3d70e284f60cb9a5d3375ca6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:12:24Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:12:24Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"fix(host): DefinePlugin API_BASE_URL + bundle guard (host boots in browser)\n\nThe host bundle previously kept the live process.env.API_BASE_URL\nexpression (the only env ref in the bundle; verified before the fix). With\nwebpack 5''s web target the browser has no process object, so the ENTIRE\nhost (/, /demo, both remote compositions) rendered a blank page. Now the\nhost webpack config defines process.env.API_BASE_URL at build time (same\nas requester/approver) and a new postbuild guard\n(frontend/scripts/guard-no-process-env.mjs) fails the build if ANY chunk\nstill contains a process.env literal (proven: 6 chunks, zero literals, OK;\ninjected leak -> exit 1). client.js comment now reflects reality.","tree":{"sha":"b26c28903cf903abf8e21581fa62a05e05785ff4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/b26c28903cf903abf8e21581fa62a05e05785ff4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/256da4bf560e0bfc3d70e284f60cb9a5d3375ca6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/256da4bf560e0bfc3d70e284f60cb9a5d3375ca6","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDI1NmRhNGJmNTYwZTBiZmMzZDcwZTI4NGY2MGNiOWE1ZDMzNzVjYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/2e2c162808aec414886eea4a34718210919ef8ef","sha":"2e2c162808aec414886eea4a34718210919ef8ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/2e2c162808aec414886eea4a34718210919ef8ef"}],"sha":"256da4bf560e0bfc3d70e284f60cb9a5d3375ca6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/256da4bf560e0bfc3d70e284f60cb9a5d3375ca6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/2e2c162808aec414886eea4a34718210919ef8ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:03:31Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:03:31Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"fix(root): wait for dynamodb-local readiness in demo:setup\n\ndocker compose up -d returns before the Java container opens port 8000;\nchaining db:create-table immediately was flaky on cold start (ECONNRESET /\nTimeoutError). A 3s pause between db:up and db:create-table makes the\none-shot quick path reliable (proven cold-start: db:down -> demo:setup\n-> 4 seeded, exit 0).","tree":{"sha":"c4e894f75588f4906e940840816cc86c46942989","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/c4e894f75588f4906e940840816cc86c46942989"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/2e2c162808aec414886eea4a34718210919ef8ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/2e2c162808aec414886eea4a34718210919ef8ef","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDJlMmMxNjI4MDhhZWM0MTQ4ODZlZWE0YTM0NzE4MjEwOTE5ZWY4ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/babf25a091193fbb77509edba28babc5c8a1edd6","sha":"babf25a091193fbb77509edba28babc5c8a1edd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/babf25a091193fbb77509edba28babc5c8a1edd6"}],"sha":"2e2c162808aec414886eea4a34718210919ef8ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/2e2c162808aec414886eea4a34718210919ef8ef"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/babf25a091193fbb77509edba28babc5c8a1edd6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:59:27Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:59:27Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"docs(readme,manual-testing,openapi): demo fixes\n\nREADME: quick path now copies backend/.env (template carries\nEVIDENCE_STORE=memory + APPROVER_BASE_URL), uses one-shot pnpm run\ndemo:setup, and documents the demo hub at / with per-recipient inbox;\nwalkthrough step 4 drops the manual host replacement (links already point\nat :3000); local evidence + APPROVER_BASE_URL notes; 8.3 pre-deploy\ncleanup gains EVIDENCE_STORE removal. MANUAL-TESTING: status banner ->\nPR #9 demo fixes, .env variable table, /mock-mail?to= curls (filter + 400),\nlocal in-memory evidence note. openapi.yaml: /mock-mail documents the\noptional to query parameter (200 filter / 400 malformed / 500).","tree":{"sha":"cdab2a7a6ff086af1f2dac41e8cad4d64c74e1d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/cdab2a7a6ff086af1f2dac41e8cad4d64c74e1d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/babf25a091193fbb77509edba28babc5c8a1edd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/babf25a091193fbb77509edba28babc5c8a1edd6","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGJhYmYyNWEwOTExOTNmYmI3NzUwOWVkYmEyOGJhYmM1YzhhMWVkZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/3f18debb65b8f54b3a084be3007a0ad5f5848ca0","sha":"3f18debb65b8f54b3a084be3007a0ad5f5848ca0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/3f18debb65b8f54b3a084be3007a0ad5f5848ca0"}],"sha":"babf25a091193fbb77509edba28babc5c8a1edd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/babf25a091193fbb77509edba28babc5c8a1edd6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/3f18debb65b8f54b3a084be3007a0ad5f5848ca0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:57:23Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:57:23Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"chore(root): demo:setup script\n\nOne-shot quick path for the local demo: db:up (dynamodb-local),\ndb:create-table (in-memory container resets) and db:seed (demo cast) in a\nsingle command; alternative to README quick-path steps 3-5.","tree":{"sha":"3f0f15d4d1020ce18cfa5b252fa54a2673550e75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/3f0f15d4d1020ce18cfa5b252fa54a2673550e75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/3f18debb65b8f54b3a084be3007a0ad5f5848ca0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/3f18debb65b8f54b3a084be3007a0ad5f5848ca0","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDNmMThkZWJiNjViOGY1NGIzYTA4NGJlMzAwN2EwYWQ1ZjU4NDhjYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/9288e619b10bc310dbf40106227f7221ab56e602","sha":"9288e619b10bc310dbf40106227f7221ab56e602","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/9288e619b10bc310dbf40106227f7221ab56e602"}],"sha":"3f18debb65b8f54b3a084be3007a0ad5f5848ca0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/3f18debb65b8f54b3a084be3007a0ad5f5848ca0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/9288e619b10bc310dbf40106227f7221ab56e602/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:57:11Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:57:11Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"feat(requester): empty-users seed hint\n\nWhen GET /api/users returns no users (fresh db:up before db:seed), the\ncreate form now shows an English hint — ''No users registered — run pnpm -C\nbackend run db:seed to load the demo cast'' — instead of empty selectors.\nusers state starts null (loading) so the form keeps rendering while the\nusers list loads and the hint only replaces it once the registry is\nconfirmed empty; selectors guard against the null list. RTL test covers\nthe empty-registry path (hint visible, no create button).","tree":{"sha":"1b23d7286c15968f96433ceff8f8d92039c7aa4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/1b23d7286c15968f96433ceff8f8d92039c7aa4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/9288e619b10bc310dbf40106227f7221ab56e602","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/9288e619b10bc310dbf40106227f7221ab56e602","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDkyODhlNjE5YjEwYmMzMTBkYmY0MDEwNjIyN2Y3MjIxYWI1NmU2MDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/23bb193350e1ffd58e3c90610728a411a04d2c09","sha":"23bb193350e1ffd58e3c90610728a411a04d2c09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/23bb193350e1ffd58e3c90610728a411a04d2c09"}],"sha":"9288e619b10bc310dbf40106227f7221ab56e602","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/9288e619b10bc310dbf40106227f7221ab56e602"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/23bb193350e1ffd58e3c90610728a411a04d2c09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:54:39Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:54:39Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"config(demo): local APPROVER_BASE_URL + EVIDENCE_STORE in .env.example\n\nEVIDENCE_STORE=memory makes the local PDF evidence flow work without AWS\ncredentials (in-memory store; deploy keeps the variable removed -> S3).\nAPPROVER_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000 makes mailed approval links open\nthe host origin directly, which composes the approver remote at /approve —\nno manual host replacement in the demo. Both carry deploy notes.","tree":{"sha":"99aee479930cea605887536beac0d4658e6fdd77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/99aee479930cea605887536beac0d4658e6fdd77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/23bb193350e1ffd58e3c90610728a411a04d2c09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/23bb193350e1ffd58e3c90610728a411a04d2c09","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDIzYmIxOTMzNTBlMWZmZDU4ZTNjOTA2MTA3MjhhNDExYTA0ZDJjMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/a7538cfea022630e930fbe91c58b718c6a50a30c","sha":"a7538cfea022630e930fbe91c58b718c6a50a30c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/a7538cfea022630e930fbe91c58b718c6a50a30c"}],"sha":"23bb193350e1ffd58e3c90610728a411a04d2c09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/23bb193350e1ffd58e3c90610728a411a04d2c09"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/a7538cfea022630e930fbe91c58b718c6a50a30c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:54:20Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:54:20Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"feat(infrastructure): in-memory evidence store for local demo\n\nmakeEvidenceStore() is now env-driven: EVIDENCE_STORE=memory returns a\nMap-backed InMemoryEvidenceStore (same EvidenceStorePort semantics: put\nreturns void, get returns bytes or undefined -> 404) so Download PDF works\nlocally without AWS credentials; unset keeps the S3 adapter as the deploy\ndefault. Unit tests cover the memory store round-trip/overwrite/missing-key\nand the env switch (memory vs s3).","tree":{"sha":"59771b4ff35813efea1ab180ce6703b4c5af082b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/59771b4ff35813efea1ab180ce6703b4c5af082b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/a7538cfea022630e930fbe91c58b718c6a50a30c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/a7538cfea022630e930fbe91c58b718c6a50a30c","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGE3NTM4Y2ZlYTAyMjYzMGU5MzBmYmU5MWM1OGI3MThjNmE1MGEzMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/3d118f3047827b8d3dacfaa4f9c680afdc3a1b81","sha":"3d118f3047827b8d3dacfaa4f9c680afdc3a1b81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/3d118f3047827b8d3dacfaa4f9c680afdc3a1b81"}],"sha":"a7538cfea022630e930fbe91c58b718c6a50a30c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/a7538cfea022630e930fbe91c58b718c6a50a30c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/3d118f3047827b8d3dacfaa4f9c680afdc3a1b81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:53:32Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:53:32Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"feat(host): demo hub + approver console with request/approver cards\n\nLandingPage becomes the demo hub: consent-signature one-liner, two cards\n(Requester panel -> /requester, Approver console -> /demo) and a demo-tips\nstrip (seed cast, inbox URL, ports). New /demo route hosts the approver\nconsole (DemoPage): request cards (title, amount, status) from\nGET /api/purchase-requests, empty state, expand to the 3 approver cards\n(detail fetch), and clicking an approver resolves their real approval link\nvia GET /mock-mail?to=<email> (matched by request_id, origin-agnostic) and\nnavigates there — always through the token-gated /approve flow, never\nbypassing the gate. New host api/ folder (client, mappers, requests, mail)\nper folder convention with colocated tests; ''@'' alias wired in jest +\nwebpack for the host; user-event added as host devDependency.","tree":{"sha":"07ff56414a246bcea3de105e59a1ee25c8652085","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/07ff56414a246bcea3de105e59a1ee25c8652085"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/3d118f3047827b8d3dacfaa4f9c680afdc3a1b81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/3d118f3047827b8d3dacfaa4f9c680afdc3a1b81","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDNkMTE4ZjMwNDc4MjdiOGQzZGFjZmFhNGY5YzY4MGFmZGMzYTFiODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/e9407715cf80aff5ae2889bbaf00de6167348fcc","sha":"e9407715cf80aff5ae2889bbaf00de6167348fcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/e9407715cf80aff5ae2889bbaf00de6167348fcc"}],"sha":"3d118f3047827b8d3dacfaa4f9c680afdc3a1b81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/3d118f3047827b8d3dacfaa4f9c680afdc3a1b81"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/e9407715cf80aff5ae2889bbaf00de6167348fcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:50:22Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:50:22Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"feat(api): filter /mock-mail by recipient\n\nGET /mock-mail accepts an optional ?to=<email> query param (demo ''one\nuser''s inbox''). The handler validates the shape (Email value, 400 on\nmalformed), normalizes the recipient, and passes it to the log; the repo\nfilters in memory on the already-loaded newest-first list so ordering is\npreserved. MailLog.list gains an optional recipient filter (callers with\nno argument are unaffected). Unit tests cover filter/order/validation;\nnew mockMail.integration.test.ts covers the real DynamoDB round-trip.","tree":{"sha":"2a3b31c8c33fed32ef7e262a607c8a80982d1884","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/2a3b31c8c33fed32ef7e262a607c8a80982d1884"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/e9407715cf80aff5ae2889bbaf00de6167348fcc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/e9407715cf80aff5ae2889bbaf00de6167348fcc","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGU5NDA3NzE1Y2Y4MGFmZjVhZTI4ODliYmFmMDBkZTYxNjczNDhmY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/4cb6b1f53931d72a30956ce316d29020f3663077","sha":"4cb6b1f53931d72a30956ce316d29020f3663077","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/4cb6b1f53931d72a30956ce316d29020f3663077"}],"sha":"e9407715cf80aff5ae2889bbaf00de6167