ion failure keeps COMPLETED with no evidenceKey and download 404 until\na successful generation exists (R4).","tree":{"sha":"a99a647a11735b799c62ed42386ea963a3c87662","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/a99a647a11735b799c62ed42386ea963a3c87662"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/555722759293d0f4c65a87b93f662f1297140086","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/555722759293d0f4c65a87b93f662f1297140086","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDU1NTcyMjc1OTI5M2QwZjRjNjVhODdiOTNmNjYyZjEyOTcxNDAwODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/f9e923845cdb0870c067e69c2747e68667ea6cca","sha":"f9e923845cdb0870c067e69c2747e68667ea6cca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/f9e923845cdb0870c067e69c2747e68667ea6cca"}],"sha":"555722759293d0f4c65a87b93f662f1297140086","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/555722759293d0f4c65a87b93f662f1297140086"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/f9e923845cdb0870c067e69c2747e68667ea6cca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T01:15:17Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T01:15:17Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"test(evidence): unit coverage for generator, store, wiring, download (task 5.5)\n\nPdfGenerator output re-parsed with pdf-lib: valid single-page PDF containing\n\"Requester: <createdBy.name>\" + the 3 signature rows with registered names\nand timestamps (R1). S3EvidenceStore adapter via mocked client (key +\napplication/pdf, NoSuchKey → undefined). ApproveRequest evidence wiring:\ndeterministic key, attribute_not_exists(evidenceKey) condition asserted on\nthe fake repo, generation/upload failure keeps COMPLETED with no evidenceKey\n(R4), replay guard, CAS loser never touches the store. Download handler\n200/404 matrix (R3/R4). Adapter recordEvidence condition + get evidenceKey\nmapping.","tree":{"sha":"94c537110481b130da4e8b4af64da06de96492c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/94c537110481b130da4e8b4af64da06de96492c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/f9e923845cdb0870c067e69c2747e68667ea6cca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/f9e923845cdb0870c067e69c2747e68667ea6cca","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGY5ZTkyMzg0NWNkYjA4NzBjMDY3ZTY5YzI3NDdlNjg2NjdlYTZjY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/a6d16d57602b2c79b17b5b14016594552d51879e","sha":"a6d16d57602b2c79b17b5b14016594552d51879e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/a6d16d57602b2c79b17b5b14016594552d51879e"}],"sha":"f9e923845cdb0870c067e69c2747e68667ea6cca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/f9e923845cdb0870c067e69c2747e68667ea6cca"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/a6d16d57602b2c79b17b5b14016594552d51879e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T01:13:37Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T01:13:37Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"feat(api): add evidence download endpoint (task 5.4)\n\nGET /api/purchase-requests/{id}/evidence.pdf returns 200 application/pdf\nwith the stored bytes when the request is COMPLETED and a successful\ngeneration exists; 404 when the request is missing, not completed, has no\nrecorded evidenceKey, or the object is gone (spec R3/R4). S3 IAM\n(s3:GetObject/PutObject) was already declared on the evidence bucket.","tree":{"sha":"678f1238769c9dce0320b77d36b1e79631f784d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/678f1238769c9dce0320b77d36b1e79631f784d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/a6d16d57602b2c79b17b5b14016594552d51879e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/a6d16d57602b2c79b17b5b14016594552d51879e","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGE2ZDE2ZDU3NjAyYjJjNzliMTdiNWIxNDAxNjU5NDU1MmQ1MTg3OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/9c82acb36c0cbe186fe35eb23641f05d31bd731e","sha":"9c82acb36c0cbe186fe35eb23641f05d31bd731e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/9c82acb36c0cbe186fe35eb23641f05d31bd731e"}],"sha":"a6d16d57602b2c79b17b5b14016594552d51879e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/a6d16d57602b2c79b17b5b14016594552d51879e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/9c82acb36c0cbe186fe35eb23641f05d31bd731e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T01:13:24Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T01:13:24Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"feat(approval): wire evidence generation into the completion CAS winner (task 5.3)\n\nThe completion-CAS winner now generate → store.put under the deterministic\nkey reqs/<id>/evidence.pdf → conditional UpdateItem SET evidenceKey with\nattribute_not_exists(evidenceKey) (idempotent, design-concurrency §5). Any\ngeneration/upload failure logs and keeps status COMPLETED without setting\nevidenceKey (spec R4). The pre-CAS evidenceKey read guards replays. Adds the\nEvidenceStore port seam: production wires S3EvidenceStore, tests inject an\nin-memory store. signature.ts composition root swaps the PR #4 stub for the\nreal PdfGenerator + S3 store.","tree":{"sha":"b12c456374913733379ed0b3b154f7e9460b558a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/b12c456374913733379ed0b3b154f7e9460b558a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/9c82acb36c0cbe186fe35eb23641f05d31bd731e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/9c82acb36c0cbe186fe35eb23641f05d31bd731e","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDljODJhY2IzNmMwY2JlMTg2ZmUzNWViMjM2NDFmMDVkMzFiZDczMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/c610b76ab92a3aaf0c94aee020846a79b8f1961c","sha":"c610b76ab92a3aaf0c94aee020846a79b8f1961c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/c610b76ab92a3aaf0c94aee020846a79b8f1961c"}],"sha":"9c82acb36c0cbe186fe35eb23641f05d31bd731e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/9c82acb36c0cbe186fe35eb23641f05d31bd731e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/c610b76ab92a3aaf0c94aee020846a79b8f1961c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T01:11:15Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T01:11:15Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"feat(evidence): add EvidenceStore port + S3EvidenceStore adapter (task 5.2)\n\nS3 adapter for the evidence store (spec R2): PutObject with the\ndeterministic key reqs/<id>/evidence.pdf and ContentType application/pdf,\nGetObject returning undefined on NoSuchKey. The port seam lets integration\ntests inject an in-memory store with real PDF bytes (no LocalStack).","tree":{"sha":"5e46660544f34c1a2514683b