11/purchase-approvals/commits/415c06d5275ff3e4762e9a85125c51f5d6cec857"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/b3c1e0928e834aae8285e9240bf4f1b2e45e0a39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:21:33Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:21:33Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"docs(decisions,design-api,tasks): accurate CAS loser + validatedAt decision\n\n- tasks.md PR #4 concept: the completion-CAS loser returns 201 with the\n  current (already-completed) state — not 409.\n- design-api.md: OTP endpoints list 409 (already-acted via the shared gate);\n  note that a successful validate writes validatedAt and approve/reject\n  require it (401).\n- DECISIONS.md #22: cross-direction single-winner completion CAS\n  (status = PENDING), ConsistentRead closing the stale-read window,\n  validatedAt marker decision incl. the non-expiring residual risk.","tree":{"sha":"92928e357f58f2f6e48879a8c8918af4cd6eedd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/92928e357f58f2f6e48879a8c8918af4cd6eedd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/b3c1e0928e834aae8285e9240bf4f1b2e45e0a39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/b3c1e0928e834aae8285e9240bf4f1b2e45e0a39","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGIzYzFlMDkyOGU4MzRhYWU4Mjg1ZTkyNDBiZjRmMWIyZTQ1ZTBhMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/02cb8ef818097a58a566bb6f7d0d066a7df615f8","sha":"02cb8ef818097a58a566bb6f7d0d066a7df615f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/02cb8ef818097a58a566bb6f7d0d066a7df615f8"}],"sha":"b3c1e0928e834aae8285e9240bf4f1b2e45e0a39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/b3c1e0928e834aae8285e9240bf4f1b2e45e0a39"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/02cb8ef818097a58a566bb6f7d0d066a7df615f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:21:33Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:21:33Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"chore(ci): run unit + integration incl. dynamodb-local + focused-test guard\n\nThe concurrency suite (CAS races) was silently skipped by the declared\ncommands: backend jest skips integration without DYNAMODB_LOCAL and no CI\nexisted. Adds .github/workflows/ci.yml — a job that installs each\nindependent package, starts dynamodb-local via a services container,\ntypechecks, builds, runs unit tests, runs the integration suite with\nDYNAMODB_LOCAL set, then the root test:ci.\n\nJest 29 REMOVED the forbidOnly option (existed through 27), so instead of\nforbidOnly: true the guard is scripts/no-focused-tests.mjs wired as\npretest* hooks — any committed .only/fit/fdescribe fails every jest run.","tree":{"sha":"ce8cb3b7972b866b4caae801c160a523c7a6926a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/ce8cb3b7972b866b4caae801c160a523c7a6926a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/02cb8ef818097a58a566bb6f7d0d066a7df615f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/02cb8ef818097a58a566bb6f7d0d066a7df615f8","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDAyY2I4ZWY4MTgwOTdhNThhNTY2YmI2ZjdkMGQwNjZhN2RmNjE1Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/d27708bd41fa49023a82ad6ad63b137ace6bbb84","sha":"d27708bd41fa49023a82ad6ad63b137ace6bbb84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/d27708bd41fa49023a82ad6ad63b137ace6bbb84"}],"sha":"02cb8ef818097a58a566bb6f7d0d066a7df615f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/02cb8ef818097a58a566bb6f7d0d066a7df615f8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/d27708bd41fa49023a82ad6ad63b137ace6bbb84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:20:07Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:21:26Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"feat(application): require validated OTP before approve/reject (401)\n\nSpec R1/R2 require a validated OTP to act, but approve/reject take no code\nand the 401 branch was dead. ValidateOtp now durably writes a validatedAt\nmarker on the approver row (ApproverRepository.markValidated) — only the\nsingle OTP-consume winner reaches it. ApproveRequest/RejectRequest require\nthe marker BEFORE Step A (OtpNotValidatedError -> 401), so a token holder\nwho never proved OTP possession cannot sign or reject; the check lives in\nthe signature use cases, NOT the shared gate, so OTP issue/validate/\nregenerate are unregressed. signature.ts maps the new error (401 live);\ndesign-api 401 is now reachable. Marker does not expire (residual risk,\nnoted in DECISIONS #22).","tree":{"sha":"5862a79cd8d9238433eb3be7eb415e35e2c69c88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/5862a79cd8d9238433eb3be7eb415e35e2c69c88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/d27708bd41fa49023a82ad6ad63b137ace6bbb84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/d27708bd41fa49023a82ad6ad63b137ace6bbb84","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGQyNzcwOGJkNDFmYTQ5MDIzYTgyYWQ2YWQ2M2IxMzdhY2U2YmJiODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/44d83bb2b39971f631b0053fbb8f2b4297b533b8","sha":"44d83bb2b39971f631b0053fbb8f2b4297b533b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/44d83bb2b39971f631b0053fbb8f2b4297b533b8"}],"sha":"d27708bd41fa49023a82ad6ad63b137ace6bbb84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/d27708bd41fa49023a82ad6ad63b137ace6bbb84"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/44d83bb2b39971f631b0053fbb8f2b4297b533b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:20:02Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:20:02Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"fix(infrastructure): consistent read for the completion trigger\n\nDynamoDbRequestRepository.get() queried the approver set with default\n(eventually-consistent) read. Two concurrent signers could each read a\nstale set showing <=2 signed, so NEITHER would reach the completion CAS and\nthe request would stick PENDING forever. ConsistentRead: true guarantees a\nsigner observes a concurrent peer''s committed Step A write before deciding\nwhether to issue the completion CAS (fresh-review FIX 2).","tree":{"sha":"2e13d6e747eebe30f917221adfc0a27bebe4eb6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/2e13d6e747eebe30f917221adfc0a27bebe4eb6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/44d83bb2b39971f631b0053fbb8f2b4297b533b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/44d83bb2b39971f631b0053fbb8f2b4297b533b8","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDQ0ZDgzYmIyYjM5OTcxZjYzMWIwMDUzZmJiOGYyYjQyOTdiNTMzYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/3fd4d84ed6b9be81c8d05753cc2c846f78f6026d","sha":"3fd4d84ed6b9be81c8d05753cc2c846f78f6026d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/3fd4d84ed6b9be81c8d05753cc2c846f78f6026d"}],"sha":"44d83bb2b39971f631b0053fbb8f2b4297b533b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/44d83bb2b39971f631b0053fbb8f2b4297b533b8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/3fd4d84ed6b9be81c8d05753cc2c846f78f6026d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:19:48Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:19:48Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"fix(infrastructure): completion CAS requires status PENDING (cross-direction single-winner)\n\nThe completion CAS was only `attribute_not_exists(completedAt)`: an\nempirical Promise.all([completeIfAbsent, rejectIfPending]) probe won BOTH\n~40% of the time — reject landed first, then complete flipped the request\nREJECTED -> COMPLETED, leaving completedAt AND rejectedAt on the same row.\nThe condition is now `attribute_not_exists(completedAt) AND #status = :pending`,\nsymmetric with the reject CAS, so the REQ-level single lock holds across\ndirections: a REJECTED request can never be completed and the two terminal\nflags never coexist. The completion-CAS loser returns the rival COMPLETED\nstate (201), not a stale PENDING view — fakes model the rival writer.\n\nAdds a repo-level integration race (completeIfAbsent vs rejectIfPending,\n10 iterations, real dynamodb-local) asserting exactly-one-winner and\ncompleted XOR rejected; unit suites assert the strengthened condition\nstring and the loser contract.","tree":{"sha":"85e93e1ae0b4599ae2e8babbb19d13541a0bbe22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/85e93e1ae0b4599ae2e8babbb19d13541a0bbe22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/3fd4d84ed6b9be81c8d05753cc2c846f78f6026d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/3fd4d84ed6b9be81c8d05753cc2c846f78f6026d","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDNmZDRkODRlZDZiOWJlODFjOGQwNTc1M2NjMmM4NDZmNzhmNjAyNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/c468bc4a649f32e9e584aab478a1d5a59821e751","sha":"c468bc4a649f32e9e584aab478a1d5a59821e751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/c468bc4a649f32e9e584aab478a1d5a59821e751"}],"sha":"3fd4d84ed6b9be81c8d05753cc2c846f78f6026d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/3fd4d84ed6b9be81c8d05753cc2c846f78f6026d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/c468bc4a649f32e9e584aab478a1d5a59821e751/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:53Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:53Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"docs(decisions,tasks): document signature CAS core and mark PR #4 tasks complete\n\nDECISIONS.md #22 records the single CAS lock on the REQUEST item, the\napprove-vs-reject single-winner reasoning, and the gate 4th check. tasks.md\nmarks 4.1-4.8 [x].","tree":{"sha":"3fdbc4c3c8aa6ed6a20b107f2c0da3d49e449df1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/3fdbc4c3c8aa6ed6a20b107f2c0da3d49e449df1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/c468bc4a649f32e9e584aab478a1d5a59821e751","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/c468bc4a649f32e9e584aab478a1d5a59821e751","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGM0NjhiYzRhNjQ5ZjMyZTllNTg0YWFiNDc4YTFkNWE1OTgyMWU3NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/afb5060f7c73fd7719707d38c381a74dbf33f113","sha":"afb5060f7c73fd7719707d38c381a74dbf33f113","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/afb5060f7c73fd7719707d38c381a74dbf33f113"}],"sha":"c468bc4a649f32e9e584aab478a1d5a59821e751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/c468bc4a649f32e9e584aab478a1d5a59821e751"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/afb5060f7c73fd7719707d38c381a74dbf33f113/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:49Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:49Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"test(integration): CAS concurrency races against dynamodb-local\n\nReal DynamoDB races on a disposable table: Promise.all of two concurrent\napproves yields exactly ONE completedAt with BOTH signatures recorded and\nevidence generated once; approve-vs-reject resolves to exactly one global\nwinner (completed XOR rejected); two concurrent completion writers see the\nsingle REQ lock (one true, one false); a repeated same-approver action is\nblocked; a rejection makes every other link terminal (R2).","tree":{"sha":"47250f973717bcab5c86c08e44b010cc03d96f21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/47250f973717bcab5c86c08e44b010cc03d96f21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/afb5060f7c73fd7719707d38c381a74dbf33f113","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/afb5060f7c73fd7719707d38c381a74dbf33f113","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGFmYjUwNjBmN2M3M2ZkNzcxOTcwN2QzOGMzODFhNzRkYmYzM2YxMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/e317fc4747020b6c3980a23ac38ffca0fee9c521","sha":"e317fc4747020b6c3980a23ac38ffca0fee9c521","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/e317fc4747020b6c3980a23ac38ffca0fee9c521"}],"sha":"afb5060f7c73fd7719707d38c381a74dbf33f113","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/afb5060f7c73fd7719707d38c381a74dbf33f113"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/e317fc4747020b6c3980a23ac38ffca0fee9c521/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:46Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:46Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"feat(api): wire approve/reject handlers and routes (#10/#11)\n\nsignature.ts maps approve (201/404/403/409/410) and reject with\n{confirm:true} (201/400/404/403/409/410) through the shared error-to-HTTP\npolicy. serverless.yml adds POST api/approvals/{requestId}/token/{token}/\napprove and /reject functions bound to the handlers.","tree":{"sha":"63c21b0474b8f22a78cf96c4ccc641c9f2a5fed6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/63c21b0474b8f22a78cf96c4ccc641c9f2a5fed6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/e317fc4747020b6c3980a23ac38ffca0fee9c521","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/e317fc4747020b6c3980a23ac38ffca0fee9c521","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGUzMTdmYzQ3NDcwMjBiNmMzOTgwYTIzYWMzOGZmY2EwZmVlOWM1MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/303219bbc12fb1844184f123325c94ea4d12f38a","sha":"303219bbc12fb1844184f123325c94ea4d12f38a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/303219bbc12fb1844184f123325c94ea4d12f38a"}],"sha":"e317fc4747020b6c3980a23ac38ffca0fee9c521","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/e317fc4747020b6c3980a23ac38ffca0fee9c521"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/303219bbc12fb1844184f123325c94ea4d12f38a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:42Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:42Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"test(application): scenario suite for approval-signature R1-R4\n\nDrives the approve/reject use cases through the fakes and asserts the\nEXACT ConditionExpression emitted for BOTH compare-and-swap steps: Step A\nper-approver CAS, Step B completion CAS and Step B reject CAS. Covers\nregistered-name signing (R1), no double-sign (R4), globally-terminal reject\n(R2), 3rd-signature completion with evidence exactly once (R3), and the\ncompletion-CAS loser returning state without generating.","tree":{"sha":"4e1058a6530059d3c2d2e65d1b3ccda37c540797","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/4e1058a6530059d3c2d2e65d1b3ccda37c540797"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/303219bbc12fb1844184f123325c94ea4d12f38a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/303219bbc12fb1844184f123325c94ea4d12f38a","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDMwMzIxOWJiYzEyZmIxODQ0MTg0ZjEyMzMyNWM5NGVhNGQxMmYzOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/b88ffa21d390ad34ecf058beceaa71edef1324e3","sha":"b88ffa21d390ad34ecf058beceaa71edef1324e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/b88ffa21d390ad34ecf058beceaa71edef1324e3"}],"sha":"303219bbc12fb1844184f123325c94ea4d12f38a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/303219bbc12fb1844184f123325c94ea4d12f38a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/b88ffa21d390ad34ecf058beceaa71edef1324e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:39Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:39Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"feat(approval): reject use case — first-reject-wins global CAS\n\nRejectRequest runs the shared gate, records the rejection via the same\nStep A per-approver CAS, then issues the global reject CAS (Step B\nstatus = PENDING AND attribute_not_exists(rejectedAt)). The FIRST rejection\nwins and sets the request globally REJECTED (R2 terminal); a concurrent\napprove that already CAS''d COMPLETED makes the reject lose, returning the\ncurrent COMPLETED state.","tree":{"sha":"3e34bd1b7e6016c96e0d7e49730ab587f3812023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/3e34bd1b7e6016c96e0d7e49730ab587f3812023"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/b88ffa21d390ad34ecf058beceaa71edef1324e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/b88ffa21d390ad34ecf058beceaa71edef1324e3","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGI4OGZmYTIxZDM5MGFkMzRlY2YwNThiZWNlYWE3MWVkZWYxMzI0ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/e37ea49db35a4262ee2b96e8fb82c251d03bf8d9","sha":"e37ea49db35a4262ee2b96e8fb82c251d03bf8d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/e37ea49db35a4262ee2b96e8fb82c251d03bf8d9"}],"sha":"b88ffa21d390ad34ecf058beceaa71edef1324e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/b88ffa21d390ad34ecf058beceaa71edef1324e3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/e37ea49db35a4262ee2b96e8fb82c251d03bf8d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:35Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:35Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"feat(approval): approve use case — signature CAS, completion CAS, evidence seam\n\nApproveRequest runs the shared gate, records the signature with the\nREGISTERED snapshot name + timestamp (R1, Step A per-approver CAS), then\nre-reads the approver set; only when 3 are signed it issues the exclusive\ncompletion CAS (Step B attribute_not_exists(completedAt), R3). The CAS\nloser returns the current state and does NOT generate evidence; only the\nwinner calls the new EvidenceGeneratorPort (stubbed here, real PdfGenerator\nin PR #5).","tree":{"sha":"139ca0d33ffd28b66afc68e53d990ef3bff01856","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/139ca0d33ffd28b66afc68e53d990ef3bff01856"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/e37ea49db35a4262ee2b96e8fb82c251d03bf8d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/e37ea49db35a4262ee2b96e8fb82c251d03bf8d9","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGUzN2VhNDlkYjM1YTQyNjJlZTJiOTZlOGZiODJjMjUxZDAzYmY4ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/40cf851e97532203508b4aee2c49fafa00542f17","sha":"40cf851e97532203508b4aee2c49fafa00542f17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/40cf851e97532203508b4aee2c49fafa00542f17"}],"sha":"e37ea49db35a4262ee2b96e8fb82c251d03bf8d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/e37ea49db35a4262ee2b96e8fb82c251d03bf8d9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/40cf851e97532203508b4aee2c49fafa00542f17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:31Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:31Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"feat(approval): add CAS repository ports and DynamoDB adapters for signatures\n\nExtend ApproverRepository with markSigned/markRejected (Step A per-approver\nCAS: attribute_not_exists(status_signed) AND attribute_not_exists(status_rejected))\nand RequestRepository with completeIfAbsent (Step B completion CAS\nattribute_not_exists(completedAt)) and rejectIfPending (Step B reject CAS\nstatus = PENDING AND attribute_not_exists(rejectedAt)). Adapters emit\n#status placeholders for the reserved DynamoDB keyword. Fakes mirror the\nCAS semantics and record the exact emitted ConditionExpression for tests.","tree":{"sha":"85171136ce173535b1509f7393af01c92ff03b72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/85171136ce173535b1509f7393af01c92ff03b72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/40cf851e97532203508b4aee2c49fafa00542f17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/40cf851e97532203508b4aee2c49fafa00542f17","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKDQwY2Y4NTFlOTc1MzIyMDM1MDhiNGFlZTJjNDlmYWZhMDA1NDJmMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/efdeafb31591178b25d0e01623d86a5c7938dc26","sha":"efdeafb31591178b25d0e01623d86a5c7938dc26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/efdeafb31591178b25d0e01623d86a5c7938dc26"}],"sha":"40cf851e97532203508b4aee2c49fafa00542f17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/40cf851e97532203508b4aee2c49fafa00542f17"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/efdeafb31591178b25d0e01623d86a5c7938dc26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:27Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T00:00:27Z","email":"willopalomino@localhost","name":"Will Palomino"},"message":"feat(application): block already-acted approvers with 409 gate check\n\nAdd the 4th ApproverGate check (design-concurrency §2): an approver who\nalready signed or rejected the request is rejected with AlreadyActedError\n(HTTP 409) before any approve/reject can be retried. OTP handlers map the\nnew error so acting terminates the whole flow, not just the signature call.","tree":{"sha":"008fb02cfa043c1be423c7baf1b1da4f7530b547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/trees/008fb02cfa043c1be423c7baf1b1da4f7530b547"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/git/commits/efdeafb31591178b25d0e01623d86a5c7938dc26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/efdeafb31591178b25d0e01623d86a5c7938dc26","node_id":"C_kwDOT70mBdoAKGVmZGVhZmIzMTU5MTE3OGIyNWQwZTAxNjIzZDg2YTVjNzkzOGRjMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/willo11/purchase-approvals/commit/3e7a798bbb7f362301e56e6f1b38f62a69fe77bd","sha":"3e7a798bbb7f362301e56e6f1b38f62a69fe77bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/3e7a798bbb7f362301e56e6f1b38f62a69fe77bd"}],"sha":"efdeafb31591178b25d0e01623d86a5c7938dc26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/efdeafb31591178b25d0e01623d86a5c7938dc26"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willo11/purchase-approvals/commits/3e7a798bbb7f362301e56e6f1b38f62a69fe77bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T22:49:23Z","email":"wi