","sha":"434727d2fd634032c763f1e3d7296430289e2cb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/434727d2fd634032c763f1e3d7296430289e2cb8"}],"sha":"e0ba779dac399861dbc3e87d17caa09f35a11665","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/e0ba779dac399861dbc3e87d17caa09f35a11665"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/434727d2fd634032c763f1e3d7296430289e2cb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T13:37:54Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T13:37:54Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"docs: añade el README de la raíz, con el camino de despliegue en él\n\nEl repositorio no tenía puerta de entrada: había un README por carpeta pero\nninguno en la raíz, así que quien llegaba no sabía por dónde empezar.\n\nTrae inline todo lo necesario para levantarlo sin abrir otro archivo: requisito\núnico, el comando, la URL, los cuatro usuarios de prueba, cómo comprobar que\nlevantó, el arranque limpio y cómo cambiar puertos ocupados. Más el mapa del\nrepositorio, los seis entregables enlazados y cómo se construyó con Spec Kit.\n\nNo copia el manual de despliegue completo (E5), que sigue en\ndocs/MANUAL-DESPLIEGUE.md y al que el README apunta diciendo cuál manda si algo\ndifiere. Duplicar 236 líneas habría creado una segunda fuente de verdad que se\ndesincroniza, que es justo el patrón que la auditoría de alcance encontró cuatro\nveces en este proyecto.\n\nComandos verificados contra el sistema levantado: los once servicios, el curl del\ncatálogo, el psql que demuestra el aislamiento de datos y las variables de\npuerto, que son once y no solo GATEWAY_PORT.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a9bdc09192c67e9e88ba2eee97ad1ea02c12d089","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/a9bdc09192c67e9e88ba2eee97ad1ea02c12d089"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/434727d2fd634032c763f1e3d7296430289e2cb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/434727d2fd634032c763f1e3d7296430289e2cb8","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKDQzNDcyN2QyZmQ2MzQwMzJjNzYzZjFlM2Q3Mjk2NDMwMjg5ZTJjYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/89683029db2e7e4e6966c26a12724d64c784f351","sha":"89683029db2e7e4e6966c26a12724d64c784f351","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/89683029db2e7e4e6966c26a12724d64c784f351"}],"sha":"434727d2fd634032c763f1e3d7296430289e2cb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/434727d2fd634032c763f1e3d7296430289e2cb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/e4ed767567dd99cef09f67b75c33f071172570d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T08:13:28Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T08:13:28Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"docs: cierra la feature 003 — modelo C4, informe y auditoría (T172-T179)\n\nEl modelo C4 gana los dos componentes que ahora existen de verdad en el shell:\nChrome, que pinta el menú y la cabecera una sola vez y elige por rol, y\nNavegacion, la única definición de las entradas. Los tres contenedores de\nmicrofrontend dicen que exponen solo sus pantallas.\n\n§4 del informe explica que el menú permanece montado y que solo se reemplaza el\ncontenido central, incluso cuando la sección de destino la sirve otro\nmicrofrontend, y menciona la excepción de la pantalla de creación de reserva.\n\nNinguna otra figura cambió de geometría. Informe (56 páginas) y presentación\n(29 láminas) recompilados sin errores ni referencias sin resolver.\n\ndocs/AUDITORIA-ALCANCE.md recoge el hallazgo como cuarta observación, con la\nmedición antes y después: 2 592 ms a 64-73 ms.\n\nspeckit-commands.md deja constancia de que /speckit-constitution NO se invocó, y\npor qué: el Principio V ya exigía esto, la feature lo hace cumplir. Y de los tres\ntropiezos de implementación, incluido que el exportador de diagramas moría con\nSIGPIPE al encadenarlo a `head`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ace9aef68c4c3fccc7837ff341ec700e35f4883","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/3ace9aef68c4c3fccc7837ff341ec700e35f4883"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/e4ed767567dd99cef09f67b75c33f071172570d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/e4ed767567dd99cef09f67b75c33f071172570d5","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKGU0ZWQ3Njc1NjdkZDk5Y2VmMDlmNjdiNzVjMzNmMDcxMTcyNTcwZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/b7d1f5a5dc34dcfc5d77fb5d7c597fef3d1f17e4","sha":"b7d1f5a5dc34dcfc5d77fb5d7c597fef3d1f17e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/b7d1f5a5dc34dcfc5d77fb5d7c597fef3d1f17e4"}],"sha":"e4ed767567dd99cef09f67b75c33f071172570d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/e4ed767567dd99cef09f67b75c33f071172570d5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/b7d1f5a5dc34dcfc5d77fb5d7c597fef3d1f17e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T08:08:03Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T08:08:03Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"feat(frontend): el chrome vive en el shell y solo cambia el centro (T160-T171)\n\n859 líneas borradas, 90 escritas. El menú lateral y la cabecera pasan del layout\nde cada microfrontend al shell, que los monta una sola vez; cada remote expone\nsolo sus páginas y sigue siendo dueño de sus rutas internas.\n\nEs lo que el Principio V ya exigía —\"la navegación de nivel superior vive en el\nshell\"— y lo que el patrón de Module Federation propone. La constitución NO se\nenmienda: pasa a cumplirse.\n\nMedido con un navegador real: ir de Canchas a Reportes, que cruza de\nmf-administracion a mf-reportes, baja de 2 592 ms a 64-73 ms, el mismo coste que\nun cambio dentro del mismo remote. El menú no se remonta en ninguno de los once\nsaltos probados con los dos roles, y /perfil deja de perderlo.\n\nDesaparece la duplicación del menú: una sola definición, en shell/navegacion.ts.\nY desaparecen las cortinas de transición, que existían para encubrir el\nremontado; se borran en vez de dejarse en 0 ms, porque ya no hay nada que\nencubrir.\n\nR-015, encontrada al implementar: las variantes responsive de Tailwind no cruzan\nla frontera del remote. El shell y cada remote inyectan su propia hoja, la del\nremote se carga después, y sus utilidades base ganan a las variantes del shell\npor orden de cascada; el síntoma era la cabecera móvil visible en escritorio. La\nresponsividad del chrome se escribe con clases propias que ningún remote genera.\n\n/reservas/nueva conserva su pantalla completa vía RUTAS_SIN_CHROME, decidido con\nel equipo. Verificado que /login va sin marco y /perfil con él, y que las cuatro\ncombinaciones de rol y ancho pintan la barra que toca.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"41525dea056c4e7f542b32efd394dd50e987772d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/41525dea056c4e7f542b32efd394dd50e987772d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/b7d1f5a5dc34dcfc5d77fb5d7c597fef3d1f17e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/b7d1f5a5dc34dcfc5d77fb5d7c597fef3d1f17e4","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKGI3ZDFmNWE1ZGMzNGRjZmM1ZDc3ZmI1ZDdjNTk3ZmVmM2QxZjE3ZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/acb618f137a46dc71cb639747e99283b2dfc55db","sha":"acb618f137a46dc71cb639747e99283b2dfc55db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/acb618f137a46dc71cb639747e99283b2dfc55db"}],"sha":"b7d1f5a5dc34dcfc5d77fb5d7c597fef3d1f17e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/b7d1f5a5dc34dcfc5d77fb5d7c597fef3d1f17e4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/acb618f137a46dc71cb639747e99283b2dfc55db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:56:18Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:56:18Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"docs: feature 003 — el chrome del frontend vive en el shell (spec, plan, tareas)\n\nMueve el menú lateral y la cabecera desde el layout de cada microfrontend al\nshell, para que al navegar solo se reemplace el contenido central. Es lo que el\npatrón de Module Federation propone y lo que el Principio V ya exigía: la\nconstitución NO se enmienda, la feature hace que se cumpla.\n\nR-012: el shell ya tiene Tailwind y exactamente los mismos tokens que los\nremotes, así que el chrome se traslada sin tocar estilos. Eso es lo que mantiene\nla feature en un movimiento de componentes y no una reescritura.\n\nR-013: hay dos chromes, no uno —el del administrador y el del socio, con barras\nmóviles distintas—, y el shell elige por rol, no por remote, porque el\nadministrador ve el mismo menú en dos remotes distintos. `/reservas/nueva`\nconserva su pantalla completa mediante una lista explícita de rutas sin chrome;\nel acoplamiento que eso introduce queda documentado.\n\nR-014: las cortinas se borran en vez de dejarse en 0 ms, porque desaparece el\nremontado que encubrían.\n\n20 tareas, T160 a T179. El recorrido 1 deja el sistema con dos menús a la vez:\nfeo pero nunca roto, y revertible sin prisa.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"646d471461d9665146a7c6cdbc28b5a3e42ab061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/646d471461d9665146a7c6cdbc28b5a3e42ab061"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/acb618f137a46dc71cb639747e99283b2dfc55db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/acb618f137a46dc71cb639747e99283b2dfc55db","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKGFjYjYxOGYxMzdhNDZkYzcxY2I2Mzk3NDdlOTkyODNiMmRmYzU1ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/1caa8a71f446dfb813dd62491c69f4b78dde3528","sha":"1caa8a71f446dfb813dd62491c69f4b78dde3528","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/1caa8a71f446dfb813dd62491c69f4b78dde3528"}],"sha":"acb618f137a46dc71cb639747e99283b2dfc55db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/acb618f137a46dc71cb639747e99283b2dfc55db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/1caa8a71f446dfb813dd62491c69f4b78dde3528/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:25:25Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:25:25Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"fix(mf-reportes): sincroniza el menú y desactiva su cortina\n\nAl entrar en Reportes desaparecían \"Disponibilidad\" y \"Configuración\" del menú\nlateral. El motivo es que mf-reportes tiene su PROPIA copia de la navegación de\nadministración —cada remote es un build independiente y no comparten paquete de\ncomponentes (Principio V)—, y al añadir las dos pantallas de la feature 002 solo\nse actualizó la de mf-administracion. Ahora las dos listas son idénticas.\n\nAparece además una tercera cortina que no se desactivó en d1bfe98: mf-reportes\nno tiene CurtainTransition.tsx, la lleva incrustada en su Layout, así que la\nbúsqueda por nombre de archivo no la encontró. Queda también en 0, con la misma\nnota que los otros dos remotes.\n\nVerificado en un navegador real: partiendo de /reportes se recorren las siete\nentradas del menú y las siete llegan a su pantalla, con el menú completo en\ntodas y sin errores de consola.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8561e6b9a4965a6d092dc857bc47424693ffb7a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/8561e6b9a4965a6d092dc857bc47424693ffb7a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/1caa8a71f446dfb813dd62491c69f4b78dde3528","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/1caa8a71f446dfb813dd62491c69f4b78dde3528","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKDFjYWE4YTcxZjQ0NmRmYjgxM2RkNjI0OTFjNjlmNGI3OGRkZTM1Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/d1bfe98409707c8b130f6e8481c84647be8f6db1","sha":"d1bfe98409707c8b130f6e8481c84647be8f6db1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/d1bfe98409707c8b130f6e8481c84647be8f6db1"}],"sha":"1caa8a71f446dfb813dd62491c69f4b78dde3528","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/1caa8a71f446dfb813dd62491c69f4b78dde3528"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/d1bfe98409707c8b130f6e8481c84647be8f6db1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:19:33Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:19:33Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"fix(frontend): desactiva la cortina de transición entre secciones\n\n800 ms por navegación se leían como lentitud del sistema, no como una\ntransición: en la demostración, con seis o siete cambios de sección, son casi\ncinco segundos de pantalla azul en el bloque donde se juega el 25 % del alcance.\n\nSe bajan las SEIS constantes, no solo las dos del CSS. Bajar únicamente\n--curtain-duration habría dejado los temporizadores en 800 ms, con el contenido\ncambiando a los 400 ms y sin cortina que lo tapase: un retardo mudo, peor que la\nanimación. El propio código ya avisaba de que los valores tienen que coincidir.\n\nToca las dos cortinas: CurtainTransition, que anima el cambio de sección dentro\nde un remote, y CortinaDeEntrada, que reproduce el gesto al montar el remote.\n\nNo se borra nada: subiendo los seis valores vuelve tal como estaba. Queda\nanotado en el CSS cuáles son y por qué se bajaron.\n\nVerificado navegando con un navegador real en los dos remotes: ningún\n.curtain-panel en el DOM y el cambio de sección en 155-232 ms, que es lo que\ntarda la petición de datos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7cc94ae2cdf7f62a15bb7612f7ff53fbbeeda86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/f7cc94ae2cdf7f62a15bb7612f7ff53fbbeeda86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/d1bfe98409707c8b130f6e8481c84647be8f6db1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/d1bfe98409707c8b130f6e8481c84647be8f6db1","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKGQxYmZlOTg0MDk3MDdjOGIxMzBmNmU4NDgxYzg0NjQ3YmU4ZjZkYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/a9a2394c31c42eb3d75e5ceb1adfd354298278de","sha":"a9a2394c31c42eb3d75e5ceb1adfd354298278de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/a9a2394c31c42eb3d75e5ceb1adfd354298278de"}],"sha":"d1bfe98409707c8b130f6e8481c84647be8f6db1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/d1bfe98409707c8b130f6e8481c84647be8f6db1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/a9a2394c31c42eb3d75e5ceb1adfd354298278de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:13:32Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:13:32Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"feat(ms-reservas): configuración del tope de RN-06 (US2, T140-T159)\n\nCierra la segunda brecha de la auditoría. RN-06 pedía un límite \"configurable\"\ny hasta ahora solo se cambiaba con un UPDATE a mano sobre reservas_db.\n\nBackend: ConfigurationRepositoryPort gana la escritura; caso de uso propio\n—ConfigurationUseCase / ConfigurationService— separado de BookingService, que ya\nconcentra RN-01 a RN-06 y RN-08. GET y PUT /api/reservas/configuracion según el\ncontrato. Sin migración: la tabla y su fila existen desde 001.\n\nQuien APLICA RN-06 sigue siendo BookingService: esta feature solo hace escribible\nel parámetro que aquel leía. Por eso la prueba de FR-055 —bajar el tope no toca\nlas reservas ya confirmadas— amplía BookingServiceCreacionTest y no vive en el\ntest nuevo: la regla no se movió de sitio. 37 pruebas en verde en ms-reservas.\n\nCompuerta 9: los tres componentes entran en la vista 03 del DSL. El auto-layout\nlos colocó encima de otros tres y el lienzo de la vista estaba fijado en 2116 de\nalto, así que hubo que corregir coordenadas y crecer `dimensions`; verificado\nque ninguna otra figura del informe cambió de geometría. §4 del informe gana el\npárrafo del caso de uso de configuración; informe y presentación recompilados.\n\nVerificado de punta a punta con el sistema levantado: el tope a 1 rechaza la\nsegunda reserva con 409 citando el valor nuevo, devolverlo a 3 permite crear esa\nmisma reserva sin reiniciar (SC-012), y bajarlo con reservas activas las\nconserva todas confirmadas (SC-013). Un usuario final recibe 403 y un tope de 0\no negativo, 400, dejando vigente el anterior. Arranque desde cero con\n`down -v`: once contenedores sanos y el seed deja el tope en 3.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22353bc9ac23d07199a3087164a9df4628c9344b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/22353bc9ac23d07199a3087164a9df4628c9344b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/a9a2394c31c42eb3d75e5ceb1adfd354298278de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/a9a2394c31c42eb3d75e5ceb1adfd354298278de","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKGE5YTIzOTRjMzFjNDJlYjNkNzVlNWNlYjFhZGZkMzU0Mjk4Mjc4ZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/597dd352941caaad0a00b613d06159ebb33202f1","sha":"597dd352941caaad0a00b613d06159ebb33202f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/597dd352941caaad0a00b613d06159ebb33202f1"}],"sha":"a9a2394c31c42eb3d75e5ceb1adfd354298278de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/a9a2394c31c42eb3d75e5ceb1adfd354298278de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/597dd352941caaad0a00b613d06159ebb33202f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:57:34Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:57:34Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"feat(mf-administracion): el administrador consulta disponibilidad (US1, T135-T139)\n\nCierra FR-007 de la feature 001, que exigía la consulta para los dos roles y\nnunca se implementó: §3.1 la atribuye al administrador y la interfaz no se la\ndaba.\n\nSolo frontend. GET /api/reservas/disponibilidad no comprueba rol, así que no hubo\nque tocar ms-reservas, ni el contrato, ni el esquema.\n\nLa pantalla se adapta de la de mf-reservas, no se importa: el Principio V prohíbe\nque un remote importe código de otro. Y se adapta, no se copia, por tres\ndiferencias deliberadas (R-011): sin acción de reservar (FR-051), porque\nBookingService.crear devuelve 403 al administrador y sería un botón que siempre\nfalla; sin estado de selección, con los bloques como div y no como button; y\nmostrando también las canchas inactivas, que el administrador sí gestiona.\n\nVerificado en vivo con el sistema levantado: en 3 combinaciones de cancha y fecha\nel administrador y el usuario final reciben exactamente la misma respuesta del\nendpoint, incluida una con un bloque ocupado (SC-011). En pantalla, cero botones\nde reservar y cero menciones a reservar. mf-administracion compila y construye\nsolo, sin el shell ni los otros dos remotes (compuerta 2, Principio V).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb7b9e082dea639b14249216a77fbe3d6e2eee4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/cb7b9e082dea639b14249216a77fbe3d6e2eee4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/597dd352941caaad0a00b613d06159ebb33202f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/597dd352941caaad0a00b613d06159ebb33202f1","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKDU5N2RkMzUyOTQxY2FhYWQwYTAwYjYxM2QwNjE1OWViYjMzMjAyZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/d14e8b37d8339b7fa0a3eca3f7ed3405e0c67414","sha":"d14e8b37d8339b7fa0a3eca3f7ed3405e0c67414","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/d14e8b37d8339b7fa0a3eca3f7ed3405e0c67414"}],"sha":"597dd352941caaad0a00b613d06159ebb33202f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/597dd352941caaad0a00b613d06159ebb33202f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/d14e8b37d8339b7fa0a3eca3f7ed3405e0c67414/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:49:36Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:49:36Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"docs: tareas de la feature 002 (T135 a T159)\n\n25 tareas en dos fases de historia, con las fases de Setup y Foundational\nvacías y explicando por qué: no hay proyecto que inicializar ni nada que\nbloquee, porque las dos historias no comparten un solo archivo.\n\nUS1 son cinco tareas de frontend: el backend ya cumple. US2 son quince, con el\nbackend antes que la pantalla por el Principio VI, y la compuerta 9 dentro del\nrecorrido y no en una fase de pulido.\n\nAnotada la trampa de paralelización: las dos historias tocan client.ts, App.tsx\ny Layout.tsx del mismo remote, así que esos toques los hace una persona o se\nsecuencian.\n\nT159 deja escrito que el informe y la lámina 2 describen la feature 001 y sus\ncifras siguen siendo ciertas: solo se tocan si 002 se implementa antes de la\ndefensa, añadiendo sus historias en lugar de alterar los números de 001.\n\nspeckit-commands.md: registrado el mensaje de /speckit-tasks, el primero que se\npudo lanzar con la skill sin reservas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a5347fcba8d79502e7ee8e5dc025d961a401fee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/6a5347fcba8d79502e7ee8e5dc025d961a401fee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/d14e8b37d8339b7fa0a3eca3f7ed3405e0c67414","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/d14e8b37d8339b7fa0a3eca3f7ed3405e0c67414","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKGQxNGU4YjM3ZDgzMzliN2ZhMGEzZWNhM2Y3ZWQzNDA1ZTBjNjc0MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/714b4d203b50f8a94ae3b0d46827a4d5bed19ae0","sha":"714b4d203b50f8a94ae3b0d46827a4d5bed19ae0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/714b4d203b50f8a94ae3b0d46827a4d5bed19ae0"}],"sha":"d14e8b37d8339b7fa0a3eca3f7ed3405e0c67414","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/d14e8b37d8339b7fa0a3eca3f7ed3405e0c67414"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/714b4d203b50f8a94ae3b0d46827a4d5bed19ae0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:46:40Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:46:40Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"docs: plan, research y contrato de la feature 002\n\nplan.md: dos recorridos con costes muy distintos. La Historia 1 es solo frontend\n—el backend ya cumple, el endpoint de disponibilidad no comprueba rol— y no toca\nel modelo C4. La Historia 2 es una rebanada vertical corta y sí toca la compuerta\n9: tres componentes nuevos entran en la vista 03, que es la Figura 3 del informe.\n\nresearch.md: R-010 fija el recurso de configuración con cuerpo tipado y caso de\nuso separado de BookingService, y deja anotado que no hay caché que invalidar\n—BookingService lee la clave en cada creación— y que si algún día la hay, FR-053\npasa a exigir su invalidación. R-011 da las tres razones por las que la\ndisponibilidad del administrador es pantalla propia y no la de mf-reservas\nabierta a dos roles.\n\ncontracts/reservas-configuracion.yaml: declarado extensión del contrato de 001 y\nno copia, para no tener dos fuentes de verdad de /api/reservas.\n\nspeckit-commands.md: los mensajes enviados a cada comando de Spec Kit, con nota\nde cómo se ejecutó cada uno. Dos de los tres no se pudieron lanzar tal cual sobre\nun proyecto ya construido, y queda escrito por qué.\n\nSin data-model.md ni quickstart.md propios: no hay entidades nuevas y se verifica\ncon los escenarios de 001.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d976e7544485eef980954d88a393de6737a2dc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/0d976e7544485eef980954d88a393de6737a2dc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/714b4d203b50f8a94ae3b0d46827a4d5bed19ae0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/714b4d203b50f8a94ae3b0d46827a4d5bed19ae0","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKDcxNGI0ZDIwM2I1MGY4YTk0YWUzYjBkNDY4MjdhNGQ1YmVkMTlhZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/33313f647ab7d3d92eeae9858ae88ed34b86db98","sha":"33313f647ab7d3d92eeae9858ae88ed34b86db98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/33313f647ab7d3d92eeae9858ae88ed34b86db98"}],"sha":"714b4d203b50f8a94ae3b0d46827a4d5bed19ae0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/714b4d203b50f8a94ae3b0d46827a4d5bed19ae0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/33313f647ab7d3d92eeae9858ae88ed34b86db98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:40:34Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:40:34Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"docs: feature 002 — cierre de las dos brechas de la auditoría\n\nHistoria 1: el administrador consulta disponibilidad. Cierra FR-007 de 001, que\nestaba especificado para ambos roles y nunca se implementó porque faltó el\nescenario en la historia del administrador; sin él ninguna tarea lo recogió y las\ntres que implementan FR-007 quedaron bajo la historia del usuario final. El spec\nlo dice explícitamente en vez de esconderlo.\n\nHistoria 2: configuración del tope de RN-06, alcance nuevo por la enmienda 1.3.0.\n\nFR-049 a FR-056 y SC-011 a SC-013 continúan la numeración de 001 para que no haya\nidentificadores repetidos en el proyecto. Sin entidades ni migraciones nuevas.\n\n.specify/feature.json pasa a apuntar a 002, que es lo que leen /speckit-plan y\n/speckit-tasks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45bb994c75cc524e0ca716428b53c42d22644649","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/45bb994c75cc524e0ca716428b53c42d22644649"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/33313f647ab7d3d92eeae9858ae88ed34b86db98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migues