m/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/bd13d8cd9852c10660e4ba4ae18f81317486b782/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:39:07Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:39:07Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"docs: corrige dos desfases de los artefactos de 001\n\nNinguno de los dos viene de las brechas de la auditoría; se quedan en 001\naunque el trabajo nuevo se haya movido a 002.\n\nplan.md evaluaba contra la constitución v1.1.1 y hablaba de ocho compuertas.\nLa enmienda 1.2.0 añadió la novena hace días y nadie actualizó el plan; la\nreferencia a \"la octava\" apuntaba además a la que ya no es.\n\ndata-model.md afirmaba que una pantalla de configuración del tope \"sería alcance\nnuevo\". La enmienda 1.3.0 dice lo contrario. Queda anotado que la frase no tiene\nefecto y que la escritura del valor se especifica en 002.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0088f0ed81400466f69987491a9128764210f2cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/0088f0ed81400466f69987491a9128764210f2cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/bd13d8cd9852c10660e4ba4ae18f81317486b782","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"ht