ithub.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/195d7e7cf19e3cad91d638be5ff1e02a5452335b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:25:49Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:25:49Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"docs: especifica las dos brechas de la auditoría (FR-007 admin, RN-06 configurable)\n\nHistoria 2: escenario 9, el administrador consulta disponibilidad sin acción de\nreservar. FR-007 ya lo exigía para ambos roles desde el principio; lo que faltaba\nera el escenario que generase la tarea, y por eso las tres tareas que implementan\nFR-007 quedaron todas bajo la Historia 1.\n\nHistoria 5 nueva: configuración del tope de RN-06, con FR-049 a FR-053, SC-011 y\nel caso de borde del tope reducido por debajo de lo ya reservado. Entra en alcance\npor la enmienda 1.3.0 de la constitución.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"578541c766308f7aff1f142c655f60861fc70ead","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/578541c766308f7aff1f142c655f60861fc70ead"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/195d7e7cf19e3cad91d638be5ff1e02a5452335b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"htt