hub.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/1f7ea6ab23967c7fbae57672cfad6ae0caabbff0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:23:26Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T06:23:26Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"docs: enmienda la constitución a 1.3.0 (configuración de RN-06 en alcance)\n\nLa auditoría contra el documento de alcance encontró que RN-06 se aplica\ncorrectamente en BookingService.verificarTope, pero que el tope solo se puede\ncambiar con un UPDATE a mano: no hay endpoint ni pantalla. El caso es fronterizo\nbajo el Principio I porque traza a una regla de §3.4 y no a una fila de §3.1, y\nel documento ya resuelve esa ambigüedad enumerando el caso.\n\nMINOR y no PATCH por el precedente de la enmienda 1.1.0: añade una obligación\nnueva y verificable. Queda diferido a una enmienda posterior el endurecimiento\nde la compuerta 8.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a2905f4c7f9da0328ab3a954a32ff0d193da648","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/2a2905f4c7f9da0328ab3a954a32ff0d193da648"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/1f7ea6ab23967c7fbae57672cfad6ae0caabbff0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"veri