"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/8b5df11e0266f571e24db65a1ec973c651bee608","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKDhiNWRmMTFlMDI2NmY1NzFlMjRkYjY1YTFlYzk3M2M2NTFiZWU2MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/0be200fdcf590841b984b434b414dde1b730d1c5","sha":"0be200fdcf590841b984b434b414dde1b730d1c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/0be200fdcf590841b984b434b414dde1b730d1c5"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/ae63456b3f00a0f828b58e5db823ba4906942401","sha":"ae63456b3f00a0f828b58e5db823ba4906942401","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/ae63456b3f00a0f828b58e5db823ba4906942401"}],"sha":"8b5df11e0266f571e24db65a1ec973c651bee608","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/8b5df11e0266f571e24db65a1ec973c651bee608"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/c98004b8b0f7fadf5fbaa4aadba89fbfad6f0cba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T20:45:09Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T20:45:09Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"message":"fix(sesion): un 401 devuelve al inicio de sesión, con el motivo\n\nT125 pedía comprobar que el gateway rechaza a un usuario inactivado mientras\ntenía la sesión abierta. Lo hacía ya —verifica la credencial en CADA petición,\nasí que se entera al instante y no al caducar un token—, pero el frontend no\nhacía nada con ese 401: el usuario se quedaba en una pantalla donde todo fallaba\nsin decir por qué.\n\nLos cuatro clientes HTTP —shell y los tres remotes— limpian ahora la credencial\ny la sesión ante un 401 y vuelven a /login con el motivo, que Login muestra.\n\nTres decisiones:\n\n- En el shell se excluyen las rutas públicas. El 401 de un login con contraseña\n  equivocada no es una sesión caducada, y tratarlo como tal borraría la pantalla\n  llevándose por delante el mensaje que explica el fallo.\n- Se usa window.location y no el router: este archivo no es un componente, y una\n  recarga completa garantiza que ningún remote ya cargado conserve estado de la\n  sesión anterior.\n- La lógica se repite en los cuatro clientes en lugar de extraerse a un paquete\n  común. Los remotes son autónomos (Principio V): compartir código entre ellos\n  los haría dejar de ser desplegables por separado, que es justo lo que el estilo\n  existe para conseguir.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VhxFpT5rG7tHhgQ3J939Z9","tree":{"sha":"bc9d7b41ac48179f0c6586f8572d792abc44d08a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/bc9d7b41ac48179f0c6586f8572d792abc44d08a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/c98004b8b0f7fadf5fbaa4aadba89fbfad6f0cba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/c98004b8b0f7fadf5fbaa4aadba89fbfad6f0cba","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKGM5ODAwNGI4YjBmN2ZhZGY1ZmJhYTRhYWRiYTg5ZmJmYWQ2ZjBjYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/daccc9032b754a906379462d146c6cbb40fb35c2","sha":"daccc9032b754a906379462d146c6cbb40fb35c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/daccc9032b754a906379462d146c6cbb40fb35c2"}],"sha":"c98004b8b0f7fadf5fbaa4aadba89fbfad6f0cba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/c98004b8b0f7fadf5fbaa4aadba89fbfad6f0cba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/daccc9032b754a906379462d146c6cbb40fb35c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T20:44:57Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T20:44:57Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"message":"feat(usuarios): fase 6 — US4, gestión de usuarios\n\nEl administrador lista las cuentas y las activa o inactiva; una cuenta inactiva\nno entra. Escenario V5 del quickstart en verde.\n\nms-usuarios:\n- UserController nuevo para /api/usuarios/**, separado de AuthController a\n  propósito: aquello son las dos únicas rutas públicas del sistema y esto exige\n  ADMINISTRADOR. Mezclarlas obligaría a recordar cuál es cuál cada vez que se\n  añade un método.\n- FR-048 se aplica en UserService y no en el controlador, como el resto de\n  reglas de rol: en el adaptador web no se podría probar sin levantar Spring.\n- FR-047 —inactivar no toca las reservas del usuario— no necesita código que lo\n  garantice: viven en reservas_db, una base a la que este servicio no tiene\n  acceso. La independencia de datos convierte la garantía en algo estructural en\n  vez de una promesa que alguien deba recordar. La prueba fija que el servicio no\n  gane ninguna dependencia nueva por la que pudiera alcanzarlas.\n- 13 pruebas en UserServiceTest, seis nuevas.\n\nmf-administracion:\n- GestionUsuarios deja el arreglo fijo. Se retiran la columna \"correo\" —no hay\n  email en el modelo— y \"fecha de registro\", que no está en el contrato, y los\n  roles pasan de ''Jugador'' a los valores canónicos de R-001.\n\nVerificado contra el sistema en marcha: inactivar cliente2 lo deja fuera, y al\nreactivarlo entra otra vez con sus 5 reservas intactas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VhxFpT5rG7tHhgQ3J939Z9","tree":{"sha":"54de1a6e1a9081db87990c2ef311ac545d048694","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/54de1a6e1a9081db87990c2ef311ac545d048694"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-h