rl":"https://api.github.com/users/SUyaguari/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SUyaguari","id":65028259,"login":"SUyaguari","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDI4MjU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SUyaguari/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SUyaguari/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SUyaguari/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SUyaguari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SUyaguari/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SUyaguari","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/7c47e636f79e76e1c3b0d73a6524049d2109d4d1","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKDdjNDdlNjM2Zjc5ZTc2ZTFjM2IwZDczYTY1MjQwNDlkMjEwOWQ0ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/0be200fdcf590841b984b434b414dde1b730d1c5","sha":"0be200fdcf590841b984b434b414dde1b730d1c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/0be200fdcf590841b984b434b414dde1b730d1c5"}],"sha":"7c47e636f79e76e1c3b0d73a6524049d2109d4d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/7c47e636f79e76e1c3b0d73a6524049d2109d4d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/d4f043b45de3762ee51b4f0362f9954ddab1afa2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:12:56Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:12:56Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"message":"docs: compuerta 8 de US2, y arreglo del exportador de diagramas\n\nworkspace.dsl: CourtService declara RN-07 y de dónde lee el rol; el ErrorHandler\nde ms-canchas, los códigos que produce; y la llamada de ms-reservas a ms-canchas\ndeja de ser \"consulta el catálogo\" para decir que también lee los bloqueos, que\nes lo que sostiene FR-010.\n\nexportar.js — arreglo de un fallo que producía entregables incorrectos en\nsilencio. El script navegaba a `…/diagrams#clave`, cambiando solo el hash. Eso es\nuna navegación dentro del mismo documento: page.goto vuelve enseguida,\nisDiagramRendered() sigue siendo cierto PARA EL DIAGRAMA ANTERIOR, y se guardaba\nese bajo el nombre del nuevo. El archivo se escribía igual, así que no había\nerror que mirar; lo delató que el SVG de ms-canchas conservara la fecha del día\nanterior. Ahora se fuerza una carga completa con un parámetro de consulta.\n\nConviene revisar las figuras de la fase 3 con esto en mente: pudieron salir mal\nsin que nada lo avisara. Las 24 de este commit sí están verificadas una a una\ncontra la marca que cada vista debía traer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VhxFpT5rG7tHhgQ3J939Z9","tree":{"sha":"9ff55402229f732e1e729d195295d801e817e6d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/9ff55402229f732e1e729d195295d801e817e6d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/d4f043b45de3762ee51b4f0362f9954ddab1afa2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/d4f043b45de3762ee51b4f0362f9954ddab1afa2","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKGQ0ZjA0M2I0NWRlMzc2MmVlNTFiNGYwMzYyZjk5NTRkZGFiMWFmYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/df3e8c5401600513a9a42244bb37a34e0652b54a","sha":"df3e8c5401600513a9a42244bb37a34e0652b54a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/df3e8c5401600513a9a42244bb37a34e0652b54a"}],"sha":"d4f043b45de3762ee51b4f0362f9954ddab1afa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/d4f043b45de3762ee51b4f0362f9954ddab1afa2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/df3e8c5401600513a9a42244bb37a34e0652b54a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:12:42Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:12:42Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"message":"feat(catalogo): fase 4 — US2, gestión del catálogo y cancelación administrativa\n\nEl administrador gestiona canchas, bloquea por mantenimiento y cancela cualquier\nreserva. Escenario V3 del quickstart en verde.\n\nms-canchas — el lado de escritura, que faltaba:\n- CourtService aplica RN-07 en las cinco operaciones de escritura, leyendo el rol\n  de X-User-Role. La regla vive en el servicio y no en el controlador: decidir\n  quién toca el catálogo es negocio, y ahí se prueba sin levantar Spring.\n- La invariante \"cierra después de abrir\" sigue en OpeningHours, no repartida por\n  el servicio: crear y editar la comprueban por construir el objeto de valor.\n- MaintenanceBlock con su solape de fin exclusivo, igual que TimeSlot: dos\n  mantenimientos contiguos se pueden encadenar. Registrar un bloqueo NO cancela\n  las reservas que caigan dentro (§3.3.3): impide las nuevas, y sobre las\n  confirmadas decide el administrador desde el listado global.\n- 13 pruebas con el puerto mockeado, incluida la que comprueba que las cuatro\n  operaciones de escritura comparten la misma puerta de RN-07.\n\nms-reservas:\n- CourtClientPort aprende a leer los bloqueos de una cancha, otra vez por HTTP y\n  no por canchas_db (Principio IV).\n- La disponibilidad marca MANTENIMIENTO, que gana a OCUPADO cuando coinciden: si\n  hay reserva sobre un bloque bloqueado —porque el bloqueo se registró después—\n  lo que la pantalla necesita saber es que ahí no se juega, no quién lo reservó.\n- Crear sobre un bloque bloqueado da 422 y no 409: no está disputado, está fuera\n  de servicio, y reintentar no lo resuelve.\n- GET /api/reservas, el listado global de FR-035, con filtros de fecha, cancha y\n  estado. Un USUARIO_FINAL recibe 403, no la lista recortada a lo suyo: para eso\n  está /reservas/mias, y devolver algo distinto de lo pedido confunde más de lo\n  que protege.\n\nLos filtros opcionales van con COALESCE y no con `:desde IS NULL OR ...`, que es\nla forma que primero sale: esa deja un parámetro suelto en un `? IS NULL` cuyo\ntipo PostgreSQL no puede inferir, y la consulta muere con \"could not determine\ndata type of parameter $2\". Con COALESCE el tipo lo da la columna del otro\noperando. Costó dos 500 en la validación.\n\nmf-administracion:\n- GestionCanchas deja el arreglo fijo: ABM completo, activar/inactivar y un panel\n  de bloqueos de mantenimiento. El filtro ''Fútbol'' desaparece —no está en el\n  alcance— y quedan los tres deportes de R-008.\n- GestionReservas carga del listado global con sus filtros aplicados en el\n  backend, y cancela cualquiera con la misma operación que usa el dueño: la\n  diferencia de rol la aplica BookingService (RN-03).\n- Los motivos de 403, 409 y 422 se muestran tal como los da el servidor, para que\n  no se desincronicen de las reglas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VhxFpT5rG7tHhgQ3J939Z9","tree":{"sha":"c30c00d419480d4db90b48035a6df5fbae13d675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/c30c00d419480d4db90b48035a6df5fbae13d675"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/df3e8c5401600513a9a42244bb37a34e0652b54a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/df3e8c5401600513a9a42244bb37a34e0652b54a","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKGRmM2U4YzU0MDE2MDA1MTNhOWE0MjI0NGJiMzdhMzRlMDY1MmI1NGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/a851a87b3689ea013ee014498828fc9100ee9849","sha":"a851a87b3689ea013ee014498828fc9100ee9849","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/a851a87b3689ea013ee014498828fc9100ee9849"}],"sha":"df3e8c5401600513a9a42244bb37a34e0652b54a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/df3e8c5401600513a9a42244bb37a34e0652b54a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/a851a87b3689ea013ee014498828fc9100ee9849/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:49:03Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:49:03Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"message":"docs(informe): diagrama entidad-relación y alcance funcional\n\nCierra los dos huecos que quedaban de las secciones ya escritas.\n\nfiguras/modelo-datos.pdf — el DER que la sección 5 referenciaba sin que\nexistiera: el PDF imprimía literalmente \"Falta figuras/modelo-datos.pdf\" en\nun apartado que vale el 15 % de la rúbrica.\n\nEs un DER global con la frontera de cada base marcada, y no uno por base, por\nlo que dice el propio apartado: lo que se evalúa ahí es la independencia de\ndatos, y eso solo se ve cuando las tres bases aparecen juntas. La distinción\nque el diagrama existe para hacer visible es la de sus dos tipos de línea:\n\n  - continua, la clave foránea de bloqueo_mantenimiento -> cancha, que vive\n    dentro de canchas_db y por tanto puede existir;\n  - discontinua, reserva.cancha_id y reserva.usuario_id, que apuntan a tablas\n    de otras bases y NO pueden ser claves foráneas — no es que se decidiera no\n    declararlas, es que la conexión de ms-reservas ni siquiera llega ahí.\n\nLa fuente va en figuras-fuente/modelo-datos.tex, en TikZ, para que el diagrama\nse regenere con la misma cadena que el informe y no dependa de una herramienta\nde dibujo externa. Se compila con:\n  pdflatex -output-directory=../figuras modelo-datos.tex\n\n03-alcance-funcional.tex — se rellenan la matriz de roles y permisos, la tabla\nde módulos y pantallas, y las seis exclusiones de alcance con su motivo. La\nlista de lo excluido importa tanto como la de lo incluido: es lo que permite\nque lo construido esté terminado.\n\nQuedan a propósito los nueve marcadores de 07-resultados: hablan de resultados\ndel sistema completo, y uno de ellos describe la gestión administrativa del\ncatálogo, que es US2 y todavía no existe. Rellenarlos ahora sería afirmar lo\nque no se ha construido.\n\nSe ignoran además los intermedios de LaTeX, que reaparecen en cada compilación.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VhxFpT5rG7tHhgQ3J939Z9","tree":{"sha":"ba87758d36820df1a832adac67a0442a9a369540","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/ba87758d36820df1a832adac67a0442a9a369540"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/a851a87b3689ea013ee014498828fc9100ee9849","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/a851a87b3689ea013ee014498828fc9100ee9849","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKGE4NTFhODdiMzY4OWVhMDEzZWUwMTQ0OTg4MjhmYzkxMDBlZTk4NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/940cd38a715c4c167b07450b4cbbb79c10588385","sha":"940cd38a715c4c167b07450b4cbbb79c10588385","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/940cd38a715c4c167b07450b4cbbb79c10588385"}],"sha":"a851a87b3689ea013ee014498828fc9100ee9849","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/a851a87b3689ea013ee014498828fc9100ee9849"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/940cd38a715c4c167b07450b4cbbb79c10588385/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:41:33Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:41:33Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"message":"docs: compuerta 8 — diagramas C4 e informe alineados con lo construido\n\ndiagramas/workspace.dsl:\n- UserController pasa a AuthController, que es como se llama la clase, y su\n  descripción refleja las dos rutas que existen hoy.\n- Se añade AuthenticationFilter -> ms-usuarios: el gateway no consulta\n  usuarios_db, se lo pregunta a su dueño. Es lo que hace visible el\n  Principio IV en el diagrama de componentes.\n\ndiagramas/workspace.json:\n- Estaba versionado siendo una copia literal del .dsl con extensión .json.\n  Structurizr lo prefiere sobre el .dsl, así que el visor llevaba roto desde\n  el commit 49ca81e con \"Could not read JSON\". Ahora es JSON de verdad, con\n  las doce vistas, que es lo que el README dice que debe guardar.\n\ndiagramas/exportar.js:\n- Buscaba el visor en /workspace/diagrams, pero structurizr/structurizr local\n  lo sirve en /workspace/1/diagrams —justo lo que ya decía el README—. Prueba\n  ambas rutas, para seguir funcionando con el structurizr-lite.war antiguo.\n\ninforme/:\n- Se rellenan las secciones 4, 5 y 6, que estaban en marcadores: arquitectura\n  con sus cuatro vistas y tres decisiones registradas con su alternativa\n  descartada; modelo de datos con el aislamiento por credenciales, el\n  diccionario de reserva y por qué no hay claves foráneas entre bases; y las\n  ocho reglas de negocio con dónde se implementa y se prueba cada una, más el\n  razonamiento de concurrencia detrás del EXCLUDE.\n- Las 24 figuras se regeneran desde el DSL y el PDF se recompila.\n\nspecs/: se marcan como completadas las 83 tareas de las fases 1 a 3.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VhxFpT5rG7tHhgQ3J939Z9","tree":{"sha":"bc930dd9a66c4796ce4643ba2df0db13ba1aa192","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/bc930dd9a66c4796ce4643ba2df0db13ba1aa192"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/940cd38a715c4c167b07450b4cbbb79c10588385","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/940cd38a715c4c167b07450b4cbbb79c10588385","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKDk0MGNkMzhhNzE1YzRjMTY3YjA3NDUwYjRjYmJiNzljMTA1ODgzODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/e8ed5112f525d2b205df71e9028586eb2ad56dd0","sha":"e8ed5112f525d2b205df71e9028586eb2ad56dd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/e8ed5112f525d2b205df71e9028586eb2ad56dd0"}],"sha":"940cd38a715c4c167b07450b4cbbb79c10588385","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/940cd38a715c4c167b07450b4cbbb79c10588385"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/e8ed5112f525d2b205df71e9028586eb2ad56dd0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:41:17Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:41:17Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"message":"feat(reservas): fase 3 — US1, reservar y cancelar como usuario final\n\nEl MVP: consultar disponibilidad, reservar un bloque, verlo en Mis reservas y\ncancelarlo liberando el horario. Escenarios V1 y V2 del quickstart en verde.\n\nms-canchas — solo el lado de lectura del catálogo:\n- CourtService devuelve por defecto únicamente canchas activas (FR-011): la\n  regla se decide en el servicio, no en el controlador, para que no dependa de\n  por dónde entre la petición.\n- V1__canchas.sql incluye ya bloqueo_mantenimiento, como fija data-model.md,\n  aunque su administración llegue con US2.\n\nms-reservas — donde viven las reglas (Principio II):\n- BookingService implementa RN-01, RN-02, RN-06 y RN-08 al crear, y RN-03,\n  RN-04 y RN-05 al cancelar. FINALIZADA no se persiste nunca: se deriva al\n  leer comparando la hora de fin con el ahora, así el estado no puede quedar\n  desactualizado por un proceso que no corrió.\n- El reloj se inyecta en vez de llamar a LocalDateTime.now() suelto: RN-04 y\n  la derivación de FINALIZADA dependen del instante actual, y sin poder fijarlo\n  una prueba tendría que depender de la hora a la que se ejecute.\n- La restricción EXCLUDE de V1__reservas.sql sostiene RN-02 en el caso que\n  ninguna comprobación previa puede cubrir. BookingRepositoryAdapter traduce\n  su violación a SlotAlreadyBookedException para que el dominio no vea nunca\n  una excepción de base de datos (R-004).\n- **Y traduce también el deadlock**: al insertar contra un EXCLUDE, PostgreSQL\n  escribe su entrada en el índice antes de buscar conflictos, así que dos\n  transacciones simultáneas se esperan mutuamente y el motor aborta a una. Sin\n  esa rama, la mitad de las carreras devolvía 500 justo en el caso que la\n  restricción existe para cubrir. Lo destapó ConcurrenciaReservaIT.\n- CourtClientAdapter pregunta el horario a ms-canchas por HTTP; nunca lee\n  canchas_db, para la que ni siquiera tiene credencial (Principio IV). Usa\n  exchange() y no retrieve() porque hay que mirar el código antes de\n  deserializar: si no, un 404 legítimo acaba contándose como servicio caído.\n- 21 pruebas unitarias con los puertos mockeados, más ConcurrenciaReservaIT:\n  dos hilos contra PostgreSQL real, diez repeticiones, exactamente una confirma\n  (SC-004).\n\nmf-reservas:\n- Las tres pantallas dejan los arreglos fijos y consumen /api/canchas y\n  /api/reservas. El 409 de bloque ocupado y el del tope de RN-06 se muestran\n  con el motivo que da el servidor, no con un texto propio que se\n  desincronizaría de las reglas.\n- Se retiran precios y \"total a pagar\": los pagos están fuera de alcance.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VhxFpT5rG7tHhgQ3J939Z9","tree":{"sha":"2c18798dcab4da3720317cffd2682fec5440a120","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/2c18798dcab4da3720317cffd2682fec5440a120"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/e8ed5112f525d2b205df71e9028586eb2ad56dd0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/e8ed5112f525d2b205df71e9028586eb2ad56dd0","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKGU4ZWQ1MTEyZjUyNWQyYjIwNWRmNzFlOTAyODU4NmViMmFkNTZkZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/79a07ba8d5469b6589df56f790a39986c597e931","sha":"79a07ba8d5469b6589df56f790a39986c597e931","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/79a07ba8d5469b6589df56f790a39986c597e931"}],"sha":"e8ed5112f525d2b205df71e9028586eb2ad56dd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/e8ed5112f525d2b205df71e9028586eb2ad56dd0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/79a07ba8d5469b6589df56f790a39986c597e931/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:40:57Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:40:57Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"message":"feat(auth): fase 2 — rebanada vertical de autenticación\n\nCorta de arriba abajo —shell, gateway, ms-usuarios, usuarios_db— porque sin\nidentidad no hay historia demostrable: RN-03 y RN-06 no existen y ninguna\npantalla se puede abrir.\n\nms-usuarios, hexagonal:\n- domain/ sin una sola anotación de framework, y domain/exception/ sin\n  HttpStatus: la traducción a HTTP vive solo en ErrorHandler (Principio III).\n- UserService implementa FR-001 (alta siempre como USUARIO_FINAL activo),\n  FR-002 (username duplicado), FR-003 y FR-005. La contraseña equivocada y el\n  usuario inexistente dan el MISMO mensaje: si difirieran, el login serviría\n  para averiguar qué cuentas existen. El estado de la cuenta se comprueba\n  después de la contraseña, por lo mismo.\n- V1__usuarios.sql y el seed con BCrypt coste 10. Incluye `inactivo`, que es\n  lo que hace demostrable FR-005 desde el primer arranque.\n- UserServiceTest ejerce las cuatro reglas con el puerto mockeado, sin Spring\n  ni base de datos (Principio II).\n\napi-gateway:\n- AuthenticationFilter descarta PRIMERO toda cabecera X-User-* del cliente y\n  solo después escribe las suyas. Ese orden es lo que hace segura la confianza\n  entre gateway y microservicios: un microservicio cree lo que dice X-User-Id\n  precisamente porque nadie más puede escribirla.\n- ErrorHandler traduce credencial ausente o inválida a 401 y destino caído a\n  503, con el cuerpo de error uniforme de contracts/README.md.\n- AuthenticationFilterTest fija las dos garantías que solo se ven desde el\n  otro lado: la cabecera falsificada se descarta y las rutas públicas pasan.\n\nshell:\n- Fuera MOCK_USERS. login() llama a POST /api/auth/login y guarda la\n  credencial Basic solo después de que el backend la aceptó.\n- Los roles pasan a USUARIO_FINAL / ADMINISTRADOR (R-001) y la prop `token`\n  de los remotes se sustituye por `sesion` (R-002): no hay token que repartir,\n  la autenticación es Basic en cada petición.\n- Perfil queda de solo lectura (R-006): la maqueta prometía edición, foto,\n  pagos y notificaciones, y nada de eso está en el alcance.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VhxFpT5rG7tHhgQ3J939Z9","tree":{"sha":"53663d11b38e3aba62277584cb226f207894a749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/53663d11b38e3aba62277584cb226f207894a749"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/79a07ba8d5469b6589df56f790a39986c597e931","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/79a07ba8d5469b6589df56f790a39986c597e931","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKDc5YTA3YmE4ZDU0NjliNjU4OWRmNTZmNzkwYTM5OTg2YzU5N2U5MzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/cba663b97c14673e41e72489a1d671c223601d67","sha":"cba663b97c14673e41e72489a1d671c223601d67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/cba663b97c14673e41e72489a1d671c223601d67"}],"sha":"79a07ba8d5469b6589df56f790a39986c597e931","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/79a07ba8d5469b6589df56f790a39986c597e931"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/cba663b97c14673e41e72489a1d671c223601d67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:40:31Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:40:31Z","email":"adrian.espinoza1252@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Adrian Espinoza Alvarez"},"message":"feat(infra): fase 1 — PostgreSQL aislado por credenciales, edge nginx y Dockerfiles\n\nDeja el sistema arrancable con `docker compose up`, sin comportamiento de\nnegocio todavía.\n\n- infra/postgres/init/: las tres bases, un rol por base, y REVOKE CONNECT a\n  PUBLIC concediéndolo solo al dueño. La independencia de datos (Principio IV)\n  deja de ser una convención y pasa a fallar al conectar. Las contraseñas\n  llegan por variable de entorno con \\getenv, no se versiona ninguna.\n- infra/edge/nginx.conf: un solo origen para shell, remotes y /api, que es lo\n  que elimina el CORS de los chunks federados en vez de parchearlo. Los\n  upstream van en variables con resolver: así el edge levanta aunque un\n  servicio todavía no exista, en vez de negarse a arrancar entero.\n- docker-compose.yml: se corrige `unless-stoped`, y se añaden postgres (con\n  pg_isready y el volumen pgdata) y edge, el único servicio conectado a las\n  dos redes.\n- Un Dockerfile multietapa por microservicio, calcado del template, y un\n  .dockerignore por contexto de build.\n- Los cuatro frontends pierden `profiles`: Compose omite todo servicio con\n  perfil salvo que se active, y el Principio VII exige que `docker compose up`\n  a secas levante el sistema completo.\n- Se corrige el HEALTHCHECK de los frontends: `localhost` resuelve a ::1 y su\n  nginx solo escucha en IPv4, así que los cuatro quedaban unhealthy para\n  siempre y bloqueaban al edge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VhxFpT5rG7tHhgQ3J939Z9","tree":{"sha":"47debd6b605a9bd26134e2d11a299bd95df42c7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/47debd6b605a9bd26134e2d11a299bd95df42c7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/cba663b97c14673e41e72489a1d671c223601d67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57201017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdrianEspinoza92","id":57201017,"login":"AdrianEspinoza92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjAxMDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdrianEspinoza92","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/cba663b97c14673e41e72489a1d671c223601d67","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKGNiYTY2M2I5N2MxNDY