mail":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"Add quickstart guide and research documentation for sports court reservation system\n\n- Introduced a comprehensive quickstart guide for setting up and validating the system, including Docker configuration and service dependencies.\n- Created a research document detailing design decisions, role vocabulary, authentication flow, and data model constraints for the reservation system.\n- Defined canonical roles and ensured consistency across frontend and backend.\n- Established authentication mechanisms and clarified how identity is propagated through the system.\n- Specified database constraints to enforce reservation rules and prevent conflicts.\n- Updated the admin panel to reflect real-time KPIs and removed unnecessary comparisons.\n- Ensured the profile page is read-only and aligned with project scope.\n- Standardized reservation states and sports catalog values to match project requirements.\n- Routed authentication requests to the appropriate microservice and updated architectural diagrams accordingly.","tree":{"sha":"27295404a4004d9e023060ca742e3862d0340b7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/27295404a4004d9e023060ca742e3862d0340b7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/6f520bbb5174870ee5d0490c9cac598163451a50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_