ers/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/c09ab7e43c915e02efd7bd6cdcb97fd65cb03992/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T03:46:11Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T03:46:11Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"docs: ratificar la constitución del proyecto v1.1.0\n\nEstablece los siete principios rectores del integrador, cada uno anclado a un\ncriterio de la rúbrica de 100 puntos o de aceptación del alcance:\n\n  I.   Alcance cerrado y trazable      (25% alcance + 10% reportes)\n  II.  Reglas de negocio en el dominio (10% reglas; RN-02 con prueba de concurrencia)\n  III. Regla de dependencia hexagonal  (15% microservicios + 10% calidad)\n  IV.  Independencia de datos          (15% modelo de datos)\n  V.   Microfrontends autónomos        (15% microfrontends)\n  VI.  Contrato antes que implementación (15% microservicios, Swagger)\n  VII. Levantar con un solo comando    (§4.4, E4/E5/E6)\n\nAñade tres secciones: restricciones técnicas (versiones de STACK.md, puertos del\nDSL, Edge de origen único, autenticación básica con X-User-Id/X-User-Role,\naislamiento por credenciales, ms-reportes sin base, EXCLUDE para RN-02, Flyway\ncon validate, y justificación obligatoria de toda dependencia nueva contra la\nrúbrica), integración de aportes del equipo, y ocho compuertas de calidad —la\noctava exige actualizar workspace.dsl y el informe junto al código.\n\nResuelve la ambigüedad de §4.2 sobre ms-reportes a favor de §4.3: agrega vía\nREST, sin base propia. Registra el estado del repositorio al ratificar (compose\nsolo con perfil frontend, microservicios sin estructura hexagonal) como pendiente\nplanificado, no como deuda.\n\nLa enmienda 1.1.0 fija el contenido mínimo del seed (E4), incluidas reservas en\nlos tres estados de RN-08, para que los cuatro indicadores de §3.3.5 se\ndemuestren con datos.\n\nIncluye speckit-commands.md con el prompt que originó la constitución.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35ad1acad0092481271411f5d0b3ab0502d5d4c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/35ad1acad0092481271411f5d0b3ab0502d5d4c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/c09ab7e43c915e02efd7bd6cdcb97fd65cb03992","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commit/c09ab7e43c915e02efd7bd6cdcb97fd65cb03992","node_id":"C_kwDOT72o_toAKGMwOWFiN2U0M2M5MTVlMDJlZmQ3YmQ2Y2RjYjk3ZmQ2NWNiMDM5OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mi