.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/commits/682dce523521badcfd7a08b78b9e5dddffef3942/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T01:28:22Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T01:28:22Z","email":"miguel.larasj@gmail.com","name":"Miguel Lara"},"message":"esqueleto de los microservicios backend\n\nGenera los cinco proyectos Spring Boot del backend con Spring Initializr:\napi-gateway (8080), ms-usuarios (8081), ms-canchas (8082), ms-reservas\n(8083) y ms-reportes (8084), bajo el grupo com.ups.\n\nStack: Spring Boot 4.0.8, Java 21, Maven, PostgreSQL 16. Se fija 4.0.8 y\nno 4.1.x porque springdoc-openapi todavia no es compatible con esa linea\ny Swagger es entregable obligatorio (E3).\n\nDependencias por servicio:\n  - usuarios/canchas/reservas: webmvc, validation, data-jpa, flyway,\n    driver postgresql, actuator y springdoc.\n  - usuarios ademas spring-security-crypto, aislado, solo para BCrypt.\n  - reportes: sin JPA ni driver; no tiene base de datos propia y agrega\n    via REST desde reservas y canchas.\n  - api-gateway: spring-cloud-starter-gateway-server-webflux, modulo\n    reactivo, sin starter webmvc.\n\nConfiguracion en application.yml siguiendo el taller de la materia, con\nddl-auto validate (el esquema lo versiona Flyway, necesario para la\nrestriccion EXCLUDE que implementa RN-02) y credenciales externalizadas\npor variable de entorno.\n\nIncluye backend/STACK.md con las versiones resueltas y la matriz de\ndependencias, como referencia para el informe.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe0fd1dbb01ca5b4a8408c9aea936082a17462a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/trees/fe0fd1dbb01ca5b4a8408c9aea936082a17462a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguesj-hub/reserva-canchas/git/commits/682dce523521badcfd7a08b78b9e5dddffef3942","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297528077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguesj-hub","id":297528077,"login":"miguesj-hub","node_id":"U_kgDOEbvrDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguesj-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/migu