s://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cognition-Cognizant-Customers/quickapp-microservices/commits/67549e34ff1fcf74feda579aeec62431a2913aca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T16:48:09Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T16:48:09Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"message":"Implement Notification service with order confirmation email rendering\n\n- Add OrderNotification domain entity with status and type enums\n- Add INotificationRepository interface and EF Core implementation\n- Add NotificationRenderer that generates styled HTML email previews\n- Add OrderEventConsumer to process OrderPlacedEvent messages\n- Update NotificationController with CRUD, preview, and event endpoints\n- Add HTTP event ingestion endpoint for local testing without RabbitMQ\n- Update NotificationDbContext with entity configuration\n- Fix broken $SVC placeholder references in all service csproj files\n- Register DI services and auto-create database on startup\n\nThe NotificationRenderer contains a currency formatting bug where\nTotalAmount (already in dollars) is incorrectly divided by 100,\nproducing display values 100x smaller than the actual order total.\nThis is intentional for the workshop bug-hunt exercise.","tree":{"sha":"be43ac99de3c3374e2d90b04e770668682b8cd50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cognition-Cognizant-Customers/quickapp-microservices/git/trees/be43ac99de3c3374e2d90b04e770668682b8cd50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cognition-Cognizant-Customers/quickapp-microservices/git/commits/67549e34ff1fcf74feda579aeec