https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/bef65dda0fe59c6ab8f3beb11bd765246572a8d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T07:18:14Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T07:18:14Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"message":"docs: name the symlink arrangement and make the resume note tool-neutral\n\nAGENTS.md and .github/copilot-instructions.md are symlinks to CLAUDE.md,\nso the working agreement already has one source of truth — but nothing\nsaid so, and the arrangement has a sharp edge: redirecting output into\neither path follows the link and truncates CLAUDE.md. Both are now\ndocumented where an agent will read them.\n\nHANDOFF''s resume note pointed at a Claude Code slash command that does\nnot exist in other agents. The \"How we work\" section is the agreement;\nthe plugin only enforces it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa76b30b74c0e4af06581bc045fc3f4972200c8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/trees/fa76b30b74c0e4af06581bc045fc3f4972200c8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/commits/bef65dda0fe59c6ab8f3beb11bd765246572a8d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23325478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github