parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu/moonpool/commit/a6ddc1275432a02ed15ee5f8db3547e6124b0217","sha":"a6ddc1275432a02ed15ee5f8db3547e6124b0217","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/a6ddc1275432a02ed15ee5f8db3547e6124b0217"}],"sha":"796769ba9da87ee7d01335771b460f57eb99306c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/796769ba9da87ee7d01335771b460f57eb99306c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23325478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu","id":23325478,"login":"WillowRyu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzI1NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/a6ddc1275432a02ed15ee5f8db3547e6124b0217/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T09:20:59Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T09:20:59Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"message":"feat: enforce granted scopes at dispatch and serve profile.get (SPEC 6.3, 9.3)\n\nThe first time grantedScopes is consulted. The check runs above the\nmethod lookup, so an ungranted namespace answers -32000 for every name,\nreal or not; only `portal` is exempt, by exact match. grantedScopes is\nnow computed once per connection, outside the message handler, and\nshared by the handshake reply and the gate.\n\nprofile.get is the first scoped method. Capability handlers are\ninjected through HostConfig.capabilities, one typed slot per §6.3\nnamespace: an empty slot answers -32001, a failing provider answers\n-32603 with a fixed message and is re-thrown via queueMicrotask so the\nhost sees it (same shape as the transport''s handler isolation). The\nresult is rebuilt from the two §6.3 fields only, so a provider that\nreturns its whole user record cannot leak, and an undefined avatarUrl\nnever crosses a structured-clone transport.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d234f91bcb37c0c59bcea781bf17f1d875fe9da3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/trees/d234f91bcb37c0c59bcea781bf17f1d875fe9da3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/commits/a6ddc1275432a02ed15ee5f8db3547e6124b0217","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23325478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu","id":23325478,"login":"WillowRyu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzI1NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu/moonpool/commit/a6ddc1275432a02ed15ee5f8db3547e6124b0217","node_id":"C_kwDOT7-1TtoAKGE2ZGRjMTI3NTQzMmEwMmVkMTVlZTVmOGRiMzU0N2U2MTI0YjAyMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu/moonpool/commit/d2bff6e76f91a41fed81acb9b71c7174e76e0bb7","sha":"d2bff6e76f91a41fed81acb9b71c7174e76e0bb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/d2bff6e76f91a41fed81acb9b71c7174e76e0bb7"}],"sha":"a6ddc1275432a02ed15ee5f8db3547e6124b0217","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/a6ddc1275432a02ed15ee5f8db3547e6124b0217"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23325478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu","id":23325478,"login":"WillowRyu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzI1NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/d2bff6e76f91a41fed81acb9b71c7174e76e0bb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:19:54Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:19:54Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"message":"docs: close out E3 and hand off E4\n\nRecords that the load race the previous handoff planned around does not\nexist, and corrects the measurement that was asserted twice in its place:\nan iframe''s `load` fires before the new document''s first message, 6/6 in\nChrome. The argument against a load-based reload detector is that the two\nevents come from different task sources with unspecified relative ordering,\nnot that load is late.\n\nHands off E4 with the gap that matters named: scope enforcement has never\nrun. grantedScopes is computed and rendered but nothing consults it, and\n-32000 appears nowhere in the codebase.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa11c0ba28fd0a1f79ed252d07b0ba9f396553f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/trees/aa11c0ba28fd0a1f79ed252d07b0ba9f396553f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/commits/d2bff6e76f91a41fed81acb9b71c7174e76e0bb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23325478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu","id":23325478,"login":"WillowRyu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzI1NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu/moonpool/commit/d2bff6e76f91a41fed81acb9b71c7174e76e0bb7","node_id":"C_kwDOT7-1TtoAKGQyYmZmNmU3NmY5MWE0MWZlZDgxYWNiOWI3MWM3MTc0ZTc2ZTBiYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu/moonpool/commit/671bdddd26a64b28498c8622d5d961bc01fa9f6c","sha":"671bdddd26a64b28498c8622d5d961bc01fa9f6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/671bdddd26a64b28498c8622d5d961bc01fa9f6c"}],"sha":"d2bff6e76f91a41fed81acb9b71c7174e76e0bb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/d2bff6e76f91a41fed81acb9b71c7174e76e0bb7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23325478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu","id":23325478,"login":"WillowRyu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzI1NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/671bdddd26a64b28498c8622d5d961bc01fa9f6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:18:37Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:18:37Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"message":"chore: ignore the local Claude Code launch config\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8949377e6bf2e70602a0cca175d6a72d6f3bc095","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/trees/8949377e6bf2e70602a0cca175d6a72d6f3bc095"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/commits/671bdddd26a64b28498c8622d5d961bc01fa9f6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23325478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu","id":23325478,"login":"WillowRyu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzI1NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu/moonpool/commit/671bdddd26a64b28498c8622d5d961bc01fa9f6c","node_id":"C_kwDOT7-1TtoAKDY3MWJkZGRkMjZhNjRiMjg0OThjODYyMmQ1ZDk2MWJjMDFmYTlmNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu/moonpool/commit/71e12627ceeffae4857c06bd5934f1d3e1049b97","sha":"71e12627ceeffae4857c06bd5934f1d3e1049b97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/71e12627ceeffae4857c06bd5934f1d3e1049b97"}],"sha":"671bdddd26a64b28498c8622d5d961bc01fa9f6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/671bdddd26a64b28498c8622d5d961bc01fa9f6c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23325478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu","id":23325478,"login":"WillowRyu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzI1NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/71e12627ceeffae4857c06bd5934f1d3e1049b97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:18:37Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:18:37Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"message":"fix: accept a repeat handshake (SPEC 5.1)\n\nThe `!initialized` guard enforced \"you may only introduce yourself once per\nconnection\", which was a faithful reading of the old SPEC 5 and a wrong rule.\nA reloaded Portal is a new document with no memory reaching the host down an\nold pipe, and it fell through every branch to -32601 -- \"unknown method:\nportal.initialize\" -- leaving the bridge dead for the rest of that document''s\nlife. Reproduced in the browser before the fix, and reconnecting after it.\n\nDeleting the guard is the whole change: re-setting `initialized` is\nidempotent, -32004 still leaves the connection uninitialized, and the -32005\ngate is untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2161917bc8a2cab2846614c6b5b27850d9cf09d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/trees/2161917bc8a2cab2846614c6b5b27850d9cf09d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/commits/71e12627ceeffae4857c06bd5934f1d3e1049b97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23325478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu","id":23325478,"login":"WillowRyu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzI1NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu/moonpool/commit/71e12627ceeffae4857c06bd5934f1d3e1049b97","node_id":"C_kwDOT7-1TtoAKDcxZTEyNjI3Y2VlZmZhZTQ4NTdjMDZiZDU5MzRmMWQzZTEwNDliOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu/moonpool/commit/3e556ea829e87b793e175dd7a42c88fb45635918","sha":"3e556ea829e87b793e175dd7a42c88fb45635918","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/3e556ea829e87b793e175dd7a42c88fb45635918"}],"sha":"71e12627ceeffae4857c06bd5934f1d3e1049b97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/71e12627ceeffae4857c06bd5934f1d3e1049b97"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23325478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu","id":23325478,"login":"WillowRyu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzI1NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/3e556ea829e87b793e175dd7a42c88fb45635918/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:18:31Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:18:31Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"message":"feat: connect the examples over a real cross-origin bridge\n\nmock-host builds an iframe transport onto the Portal it embeds and hands it\nto the pure host kernel; hello-miniapp opens its side onto window.parent and\nperforms the SPEC 5 handshake. First handshake in this project to cross a\nreal origin boundary rather than an in-memory transport pair.\n\nBoth transports are constructed in the same synchronous task that creates\nthe iframe, which is what makes the handshake safe to lose sleep over: a\nparent script runs to completion before any script inside the iframe can\nrun, so the host is listening before the Portal exists.\n\nThe host grants profile but not storage, though the manifest declares both.\nThe intersection is what the mini app renders, so the permission model is\nvisible on screen rather than only in a test.\n\nhello-miniapp refuses to run outside a Portal instead of posting into its own\nwindow and waiting out the 30 s timeout in silence.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"53e7c8b8720a73b3cad76379c6875aa1fd02e42e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/trees/53e7c8b8720a73b3cad76379c6875aa1fd02e42e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/commits/3e556ea829e87b793e175dd7a42c88fb45635918","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23325478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu","id":23325478,"login":"WillowRyu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzI1NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu/moonpool/commit/3e556ea829e87b793e175dd7a42c88fb45635918","node_id":"C_kwDOT7-1TtoAKDNlNTU2ZWE4MjllODdiNzkzZTE3NWRkN2E0MmM4OGZiNDU2MzU5MTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu/moonpool/commit/225fd21e5c6b6d1721fcbf5561bd4cd5a6210e82","sha":"225fd21e5c6b6d1721fcbf5561bd4cd5a6210e82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/225fd21e5c6b6d1721fcbf5561bd4cd5a6210e82"}],"sha":"3e556ea829e87b793e175dd7a42c88fb45635918","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/3e556ea829e87b793e175dd7a42c88fb45635918"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23325478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WillowRyu","id":23325478,"login":"WillowRyu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzI1NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/commits/225fd21e5c6b6d1721fcbf5561bd4cd5a6210e82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:52:21Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:52:21Z","email":"stainer1004@gmail.com","name":"siwon ryu"},"message":"docs: specify the repeat handshake (SPEC 5.1)\n\nA Portal''s document can be replaced while its transport stays alive -- a\nreload, an in-page navigation, a multi-page mini app following a link, a web\nview recovering from renderer termination (ADR 0002). Every one of those is a\nnew client with a fresh id sequence talking down an old pipe, and SPEC 5''s\n\"first request on a connection\" quietly assumed connection == document.\n\nThe host cannot learn about the swap from the transport without widening the\nplatform boundary every native port implements, and cannot learn it from an\nembedder signal without depending on unspecified cross-task-source ordering\nfor a security-relevant boundary. The handshake is the only signal ordered\ncorrectly by construction, so it is the one the host acts on.\n\nAlso settled here, since one edit touches both: -32004 marks a version\nunsupported, not a connection poisoned, so a corrected retry is allowed.\n\nThe reset list is closed rather than open -- reset only what is enumerated --\nbecause \"reset what belonged to the document\" fails open when an implementer\njudges wrong. Two rows are load bearing: rate-limit counters must survive, or\nany future -32006 policy is unenforceable; consent already asked for must\nsurvive, or repeat handshakes become an unlimited supply of permission\ndialogs.\n\nRecorded in section 11: repeat handshakes make stale responses from a\nprevious document more frequent, and they resolve a new document''s promise\nwith the wrong data silently. Accepted knowingly -- same principal, and\nrefusing repeat handshakes would break multi-page mini apps outright.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"780dc0e577acf9c057eb135e6796bfd9b5f4e10e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/trees/780dc0e577acf9c057eb135e6796bfd9b5f4e10e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WillowRyu/moonpool/git/commits/225fd21e5c6b6d1721fcbf5561bd4cd5a6210e82","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23325478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillowRyu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt