ystem: Centralized `:core:designsystem` for consistent\n  Material 3 theming and UI components across all MicroApps.\n- Modular Infrastructure: Dedicated core modules for Network (Retrofit),\n  Persistence (Room/DataStore), and Common abstractions.\n- Feature Isolation: Independent MicroApp modules (`preauth`, `onboarding`,\n  `dashboard`, `profile`) following strict loose-coupling principles.\n- Architecture Blueprints: Integrated `.gemini/` agent specifications\n  defining standards for routing, data flow, and presentation layers.\n\nTech Stack: Kotlin, Compose, Hilt, Navigation Compose, Coroutines/Flow, KSP.","tree":{"sha":"063f8417a56740b79f544587d104f6e6eadac0ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azlaan95/AndroidMicroFrontend/git/trees/063f8417a56740b79f544587d104f6e6eadac0ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azlaan95/AndroidMicroFrontend/git/commits/f77c5d0efd2e021a36183137f25c7edacf893843","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64401547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azlaan95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azlaan95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azlaan95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azlaan95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/azlaan95","id":64401547,"login":"azlaan95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDAxNTQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azlaan95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azlaan95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azlaan95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azlaan95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azlaan95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/azlaan95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/a